<naṃ0 4919>
<nāma- yaṃtracintāmaṇiḥ>
<karttā- dāmodaraḥ gaṅgādhara putraḥ>
<patrasaṃkhyā-12 patrāṇi >
<viṣaya- tantram>

<pṛ01a> oṃśrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ oṃnamaḥ śivāyoṃnamaḥ sarasvatyai oṃnamogurave yāṃyogamāyāmamarārthavidyāṃviśeṣapūjyāṃbhṛguvaṃśajātām ta 
syātmajobhūdbhuvidharmaśīlonāmnāmahādevitiprasiddhaḥ <1> naisargavairaṃprajahnuścasatvāyāṃprāpyaduṣṭāhitarakṣakādyāḥ tasmādāsītsumativi
kasaddevadattaḥ kalāvānmānyorājñāṃsadasividuṣomādyagaṃgāpravāhaḥ utkallolīdiśidiśijanāḥkīrttipīyūṣasiṃdhuryasyānīraṃśravaṇapuṭa
kaiḥkūjitākṣāḥpivaṃti <3> gaṃgādharastattanayovaśīcavivekagāṃbhīryaguṇairudāraḥ yaṃprāpyalakṣmīścasarasvatīcatatpādayugmaṃsthiratāṃtanūnaṃ 
dāmodaraḥsarvakalāpravīṇobabhūvatasmādgaṇanāthabhaktaḥ labdhapratiṣṭogurudevabhaktomānyaḥ satāṃdharmaparāyaṇoyam <5> dṛṣṭvānekaśivā
gamāṃścabahudhācālokyasaurāgamāndevīśāstramahāgamāṃścavividhānālokyavistārataḥ karttuṃvāñchatisaṃgrahaṃsumatimāndāmodaraḥsasva
yam lokānāṃcahitāyayaṃtranikaraṃmaṃtreṇayuktaṃsphuṭam <6> preritaścaṃdracūḍenasvapnenadvijapuṃgavaḥcakārakalpaṃyaṃtrāṇāṃciṃtāmaṇiritisphuṭam <7> purākai
lāsaśikharenānādhātuvicitrite nānādrumalatākīrṇenānāpuṣpopaśobhite <8>apsarogaṇasaṃkīrṇesiddhacāraṇasevite śivabhaktaiḥsurairdaityaiḥpannagaiścavi 
rājite <9> yogadhyānaikanipuṇaistatvavidbhiḥsusevite āyudhaiścetanāvadbhirudīritajayasvanaiḥ <10> trinetraiścadvinetraiścahyekanetrairanetrakaiḥ tripādaiścaivadvipadaire 
kapādaiḥsahasraśaḥ <11>mahākrūrairmahābhīmaiḥkarālaiścavirājite iṃdrā dyairlokapādyaiścabāṇādyairasuraistathā <12> durvāsādyaiścamunibhiḥsamaṃtātparisevite evaṃbhūtecakai
lāsedevadevaḥsvayaṃśivaḥ <13> jyotirmayomṛtamayohyaciṃtyaścasadāśivaḥ avyaktovyaktarūposauyatrāstetusadāśivaḥ viṣṇunāstūyamānastusuprahṛṣṭaḥsadāśivaḥ <14> kadācidupaviṣṭoyamekāṃteparameśvaraḥ hṛ
ṣṭastuṣṭaḥprasannātmāsṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ <15> ciṃtāmaṇaukalpavaresu patreśrīcaṃdrakṣūḍasyamukhādvinirgate tasminsamāghaṭṭitapīṭhikeyaṃkṛtātradāmodarapaṃḍitena <16>
itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaunāmnimahākalpepratyakṣasiddhipradeumāmaheśvarasaṃvādedāmodarapaṃḍitoddhṛteprathamapīṭhikāsamāptā sapātudevyāḥkavarī vilāsolāsyela 
saṃtyāgirirājaputryāḥ yaṃpaśyatobhālamṛgāṃkamauleḥ kṣaṇaṃnasarvajñapadaṃ babhūva <1> ekadādevadeveśaṃdṛṣṭādevīśucismitāupagamyaśanairvākyaṃprovācajagadaṃbikā<2> devyu
vāca devadevajagannāthakaruṇākaraśaṃkara varṇāśramāścadharmāśca saṃdehāścamamaprabho <3> kautukānisakalpānipurāṇādīnicaprabho maṃtrāṇāṃviniyoga
ścayaṃtrāṇāṃnirṇayastathā <4> ācāraviratelokeyogābhyāsaḥsudurlabhaḥ durlabhaṃparamaṃjñānaṃyaṃtrakāṃḍaḥsudurlabhaḥ <5> anekamaṃtrayogovaivedoktopihidṛ
śyate tathaivāgamabhedeṣuuditāhinasaṃśayaḥ <6> evaṃdvijāścamaṃtrajñādṛśyaṃtekleśabhāginaḥ pāṣāṃḍibhiḥparābhūtānāstikairvedaniṃdakaiḥ<7> vināmaṃtrairja
pairhomairalpakleśairyathāprabho tatkṣaṇaṃjāyatesiddhiḥsusiddhā sarvakāmadā <8> vivādevyavahārecaraṇevairijayetathā etatsarvaṃyathādevasiddhyatesādhakasyahi <9>
vicāryadevadeveśarahasyaṃparamaṃvadaśrīmahādevuvācavedācāromayāproktṛṣīṇāṃtumahātmanāṃ śivadharmastumuktānāṃvaiṣṇavānāṃcavaiṣṇavaḥ <10> sauraṃsāṃkhyaṃ 
mayāproktaṃbahūnāṃsiddhimichatām śāktaṃcabahudhāproktaṃbhairavaṃbahudhāpriye <11> dharmakāmārthamokṣāṇāṃjñānaṃcaivaprakāśitaṃ rahasyaṃgopitaṃbhadresarvatrāpinasaṃśayaḥ <12> 
rahasyahīnomaṃtrastudhyānenāpiviśeṣataḥnasidhyativarārohekalpakoṭiśatairapi <13> śrīdevyuvāca prasādaṃkurudeveśasukhopāyaṃvadasvame sarahasyaṃsubodhaṃcasadyaḥpratya
yakārakaṃ <14> vināhomenajāpyenapuraścaraṇasevayā kalautusiddhyatedevatathopāyaṃvadasvanaḥ <15> śrīśivuvāca sādhusādhumahāprājñelokānāṃhitakārike i
damarthaṃnakenāpipṛṣṭohaṃpadmalocane <16> śṛṇuṣvaikāgracittenarahasyaṃkṣaṇasiddhidaṃkalpaciṃtāmaṇirnāmaguhyādguhyataraṃmahat <17> sarvāgamasyasāraṃhimaṃtrā
ṇāṃsāramuttamaṃ atharvaṇasyavedasyasārātsārataraṃmahat <18> asminkalpebhaviṣyaṃticiṃtāmaṇimayeśubheyaṃtrāṇibahudhādevikāmyakarmakarāṇica <19> etatka
lpaṃsadāyasyalikhitaṃvidyategṛhe saṃpūjyatepratidinaṃprabhāvaṃtasyameśṛṇu <20> apamṛtyubhayaṃnāstināsticaurabhayaṃtathā bhūtapretapiśācānāṃprabhāvonaivajāyate <21> 

<pṛ01ba> anyasyakapaṭaṃnūnaṃnasidhyatikadācana aviśvāsonakartavyaḥsādhakenavarānane <22> abhicāraṃbhavetkalpamaviśvāsānnasaṃśayaḥsaṃśayenakṛtaṃyaṃtraṃviparītaṃprajāyate <23> oṃrāmoṃ 
snānaṃkṛtvāśucirbhūtvāpūjayetkuladevatāṃ lekhanīyaṃprayatnenacaikāṃteyaṃtramuttamam <24>yasyakasyaprayogasyavidhireṣaḥprakīrtitaḥ dinatrayaṃprakurvītapūjāṃbhogaṃvidhānataḥ<25>trirātraṃbhūmi
śāyīsyādbrahmacaryarataḥśuciḥ tridinājjāyatesvapnaṃsādhakasyaśucismite <26> siddhaṃsādhyaṃcamaṃtraṃvaisusiddhamathavādhruvaṃ avaśyaṃvadatisvapnemaṃtrādhiṣṭhānadevatā <27>yadānajāyatesva
pnaṃtadāsādhyaṃvinirdiśet śrutvādevamukhātsvapnephalasiddhiṃvidhānataḥ<28> nocedyathāśrutaṃsvapnetattathaivavinirdiśet yathā||ādaunivāritaḥsvapnetathānyadyaṃtramuttamaṃ <29> evaṃvi-
likhyayaḥkuryātsiddhirevaprakīrtitā avagamyamayoktāniyaṃtrāṇisubahunica <30> yenayaṃtreṇamaṃtreṇasiddhiryeṣāṃprajāyate tenatenahitadgrāhyaṃniṣiddhaṃtuparityajet<31> vidhireṣaprasi
ddhotrayaṃtrāṇāṃbhūtalekalau maṃtrakoṣṭetupaśyaṃtisiddhasādhyādisādhakāḥ<32>nateṣāṃjāyatesiddhiḥkalikālekadācana nacaivasādhakolokenaivaprakṛtikojanaḥ<33>nacaikaṃrāśina-
kṣatraṃnacaikākuladevatā yaṃtraṃvījaṃtathāmaṃtraṃcaturdhābhavatipriye siddhaḥsādhyastvariścetisusiddhastutathāparaḥsiddhaḥsidhyatikālenasādhyaḥsiddhyativānavā <35> arirnikṛṃtatemū
laṃsusiddhastatkṣaṇārthadaḥtasmādevadaśārāśikālasvapnagrahodayaṃ sādhakasyamanobhāvaṃsarvaṃjñātvāsamācaret <36>||etadrahasyaṃparamaṃtvadīritaṃmaṃtrasyayaṃtrasyacasiddhidāyakam eta
dviditvākhilasiddhibhājanaṃbhavaṃtisarvebhuvisādhakāḥsadā <39> [itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaudvitīyapāṭhaḥsamāptaḥ] <2>||mahāmohanaṃ ||ekodevaḥsajayatiśivassarvaduṣṭāṃtakārīprā
dāccakraṃnayanakamalenārcitoviṣṇaveyaḥyaḥśṛṃgārīgiriśatanayādattadehārdhabhāgolokānāṃyo'vadhavidhikṛtekālakūṭaṃdadhāra <1> rājñāṃvaśyakarāṇiduṣṭapuruṣastrīṇāṃjanā
nāṃtathātānyuddhṛtyamahāgamāṃścabahudhāyaṃtrāṇivījānica asminkalpavarekrameṇavividhānāṃgādharasyātmajonityaṃsatyamatiḥpravakṣyatitarāṃdāmodaraḥsāṃprataṃ <2> śrīśi
vuvāca rājavaśyaṃmahāyaṃtraṃśṛṇudevisuśobhanaṃ kāṃsyabhājanamānīyaśuddhaṃbhasmādibhiḥkṛtaṃ<3>jātīkāṣṭenavilikhedrocanācaṃdanenaca sādhyanāma 
likhenmadhyevartulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <4> tasyopariprakurvītapadmaṃśoḍaśakarṇikaṃ akārādisvarālekhyādalepratyekakaṃkramāt <5> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagrekhā
bhistisṛbhistataḥ mallikājātikusumaiḥsitāṃbhojaiḥprapūjayet <6> anyaiścaśvetakusumaiḥsugaṃdhaiḥśvetakairapi saṃpūjyayaṃtrarājaṃtaṃmahāmohanasaṃjñakaṃ 
<7> evaṃsaptadinaṃkṛtvātrilohairveṣṭayettataḥ yodhārayedvāśirasibāhumūlethavāpunaḥ <8>yoṣiddhāpuruṣovāpikṛtaniścayasaṃyutaḥ kiṃkarāivatesa
rvevaśībhūtāḥsadaivahi <9> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauvaśīkaraṇādhikāretṛtīyapīṭhikāyāṃmahāmohanaṃnāmaprathamaṃyaṃtraṃ <1> oṃśivuvāca||
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣāmiyaṃtraṃvaivījasaṃpuṭaṃ rājavaśyakaṃśreṣṭaṃjanavaśyakaraṃparaṃ <1> ekapaṃktausamālikhyahrīṃkāraṃcacatuṣṭayaṃ hrīṃkārapuṭitaṃpa
ścātsādhyanāmalikhedbudhaḥ <2> rocanākuṃkumenaivaśrīkhaṃḍenatathaivaca anāmikāraktamiśraṃlikhedyaṃtraṃsuśobhanaṃ <3> etadyaṃtraṃtadākuryādyadākru 
ddhonarādhipaḥ vīkṣatenigaḍairbaddhaḥsarvasvaṃcāpināśituṃ <4> tadaitadyaṃtrarājaṃtusaṃpūjyavidhivatsvayaṃ nānāpuṣpaiḥsanaivedyairmāṃsaiścavividhaiḥśubhaiḥ 
<5> yathāśaktyātusaṃpūjyāḥkumāryovrāhmaṇāstathā yoginyaścasuvāsinyonamaskṛtyasuniścitam <6> tadyaṃtraṃmuṣṭikāvadhyagacchedvairājamaṃ
diraṃ tatkopaṃśamayatpāśuvaśīkaraṇamuttamaṃ <7> prasādastatkṣaṇāddevijāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ yaṃtraciṃ<0>tṛ<0>pī<0>vaśī<0>dhi<0>rājakopaśama<0>yaṃtraṃ <2> 
śrīśivuvāca ||ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmivaśyaṃyaṃtraṃmanoharaṃ <1> icchetsvasvāminaṃkartuṃyāvajjīvaṃhimānavaḥ tiryagrekhādvayaṃkuryāddīrghaṃcada
kṣiṇottare <2> aṃtetukarṇikāṃkuryāddakṣiṇecottarepunaḥ praṇavaścatathāśrīścasādhyanāmatathaivaca <3> tadaṃteśrīṃcapraṇavaṃlikhenmaṃtraṃ 
casādhakaḥ uparyapidalāṃstrīṃścatvadhobhāgetrayaṃtathā <4> dakṣiṇottarapūrveṣudaleṣuvilikhetkramāt kṣakārānsavisargāṃstu 

<pṛ02a> koṇeśrīṃkārabījakaṃ <5> evaṃlikhitvātadyaṃtraṃrocanābhūrjapatrake tamevasaṃpuṭekṣiptvāpuṭayedagninātataḥ <6> uddhṛtyasvāṃgaśītaṃ 
tuyaṃtrabhasmapivennaraḥ yāvajjīvaṃbhavettasyasavaśyonātrasaṃśayaḥ <7> tṛtīyaṃcasamākhyātaṃsvāmivaśyakaraṃparaṃ ititṛtīyapīṭhikā
yāṃsvāmivaśyakaraṃtṛtīyam śrīśivuvāca yasyakasyāpikenāpikāryaṃnirnāśitaṃbhavet tadāmahābhiyogenadivyaṃkopiprakā
rayet <1> tanmohanārthāyatadākuryāddivyaṃvicakṣaṇaḥ rocanākuṃkumenaivaṣaṭkoṇaṃbhūrjapatrake <2> pratikoṇaṃcahrīṃkāraṃmadhyadeśelikhe
nnaraḥ koṇāṃtarālehrīṃkārānvilikhettuṣaḍevahi<3>sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyehrīṃkāraiḥsarvataḥpuṭaṃ uparyadhaḥpūrvamaṃtehrīṃkārāṃścatu
rolikhet <4> tamevasaṃpuṭekṣiptvāpūjayedbhaktibhāvataḥdvitīyehnitadākṛṣyayaṃtrarājaṃsupūjitaṃ <5> divyakāleśikhāyaṃtubaddhvāyaṃtraṃpra
yatnataḥ maunasthastatragacchettupuṣpaṃvegenemānavaḥ <6> natadādurlabhaṃkiṃcidyaṃtrarājaprasādataḥ divyastaṃbhobhavennūnaṃsalokedhyeyatāmiyāt<7> 
itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārecaturthaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca yadākasyoparikruddhorājāpīchatimāritum tadātanmohanārthāyaduṣṭanigraha
ṇāyaca <1> rocanākuṃkumenaivalikhedyaṃtraṃcabhūrjake hrīṃsaḥsādhyasyanāmāṃtepunaḥhrīṃsastathaivaca <2> paścāttadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuḥko
ṇagarekhayāuparyadhodalatrīṇikoṇecaikaṃlikhedbudhaḥ<3>hrīṃkāraṃsaḥkāraṃcasaḥkāraṃhrīṃkāramevaca evaṃdaleṣusaṃpūjyapratibījaṃ 
catuṣṭayaṃ <4> tamevasaṃpuṭekṣiptvāpūjayeccavidhānataḥ duṣṭānāṃcamukhastaṃbhovaśyobhavatitatkṣaṇāt <5> rājakopaharaṃnāmaduṣṭamo
hanakaṃparaṃ evaṃsaptadinaṃkāryaṃyāvatkāryaṃsusidhyati <6> iti śrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārerājamohanaṃnāmapaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca 
yadākrūddhaḥprabhurnūnaṃghātaṃkartuṃhivāṃchati tadāsvajīvarakṣārthaṃyaṃtraṃmṛtyuṃjayaṃlikhet <1> ānīyabhūrjapatrāṇilikhedyaṃtraṃdvayoriti madhyenā
malikhitvātucatuḥkoṇaṃturekhayā <2> evaṃsaptacatuḥkoṇaṃlikhellohaśalākayā tasyoparidalatrīṇivilikheccacaturdiśam <3> 
iśānādyairlikhellalālilīlulūcadakṣiṇelelailopratyagdalelaulaṃlaḥsyadathottare <4> evaṃdvādaśadalenyasyapratyekaṃbījamekakaṃ 
triśūlaṃcacatuḥkoṇesabiṃduṃvilikhennaraḥ <5> evaṃyaṃtradvayekhyātesaṃpuṭaṃkārayettataḥ nidhāyabhūmaudadyaṃtraṃsādhakaścottarāmukhaḥ <6> tasyo
parikṣipennūnaṃsamānīyasamāṃśilāṃ paścāttatsaṃmukhaṃgacchetkopastasyapraśāmyati <7> mṛtyuṃjayaṃmahāyaṃtraṃprāṇarakṣākaraṃparaṃ yadāta
syoparikruddhaḥkālopihidurāsadaḥ <8> tathāpiyaṃtrarājoyaṃrakṣatyevanasaṃśayaḥ itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāretṛtīyapīṭhikāyāṃduṣṭa
vaśīkaraṇaṃnāmamṛtyuṃjayaṃṣaṣṭaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca vivādavijayārthaṃcayaṃtraṃkuryānmanoharaṃ madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <1> 
caturdalaṃtataḥkuryādbījayuktaṃtumānavaḥhrīṃyaṃhrīṃyaṃpratidalerocanākuṃkumenaca <2> bhūrjapatresamālikhyadugdhamadhyekṣipettataḥ tato 
gacchedvivādārthaṃjayennāstyatrasaṃśayaḥ <3> vivādavijayaṃnāmayaṃtraṃdevaiḥsupūjitaṃ nadeyaṃyasyakasyāpiyadīchetsiddhimātmanaḥ <4>
itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārevivādavijayaṃnāmasaptamaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca yadāpidaivasutraṇa 
dravyanaṣṭiḥ prajāyate dhanikoyācatedravyaṃnirdhanaṃcādhamarṇikam <1> tasyadātuṃnacecchaktirdravyabhāgaṃkathaṃ

<pṛ02ba> cana tadātanmohanārthāyayaṃtraṃmāyāmayaṃmahat  <2> rocanākuṃkumenaivabhūrjapatresuvistṛte ṣaṭkoṇaṃcakrama
madhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭitam <3> koṇāṃtarebahirlekhyāḥklīṃkārāstrayasaṃkhyakāḥ klīṃkāramekaṃvilikhetkoṇopa
risusaṃsthitam <4> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagvartulaṃyaṃtramuttamam paṃcaviṃśatihrīṃkāraiścakravatpariveṣṭayet <5> puna
stadveṣṭayetsamyagvartulaṃpūrvavatpriye etatsaptadinaṃyaṃtraṃpūjayedvidhivattataḥ <6> pratyahaṃpūjayeddevimahāyāṃvicakṣaṇaḥ 
mārkaṃḍeyapurāṇoktaṃdevīmāhātmyamuttamam <7> japetsaptadinaṃyāvattatohomaṃtukārayet aṃtepūrṇāhutiṃda
tvābhojayetkanyakātrayam <8> pratiślokaṃcajuhuyātpāyasaṃmadhusarpiṣā veṣṭayitvātrilohenabahumūlegalethavā <9> 
tenaivadhṛtamātreṇadhanikovaśyatāmiyāt nayācatesatudravyaṃvāṇijyārthaṃdadātica <10> itivaśīkaraṇādhikāre 
dhanikavaśyakaraṇakamaṣṭamaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśiva uvāca yadāyātārājaduṣṭābhavaṃtiparicāriṇaḥ yaiḥśūnyaṃkāryajā
taṃcakuruteharniśasadā <1> tadākuryānmahāyaṃtraṃduṣṭamohanasaṃjñakam madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2> 
tataścāṣṭadalaṃkṛtvābījānivilikhettataḥ sakārāḥsavisargāṃtāḥkoṇeṣusarvatonyaset <3> praṇavaṃmukhyadigle
khyaṃcaturdikṣukrameṇatu tatastadveṣṭayetsarvaṃcatuḥkoṇedvirekhayā <4> khararaktenasaṃlekhyaṃbhūrjapatremanoharam e
tadyaṃtraṃsusaṃpūjyaprakṣipeddugdhamadhyataḥ <5>duṣṭāḥsarvevinaśyaṃtirājyamānaṃdadātyapi ekaviṃśaddinaṃyāva
ttāvattatraivayaṃtrakam <6> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāreduṣṭamohanaṃnāmanavamaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmivivādejayavarddhanam vyavahārebhayebhaṃgehrīdaṃyaṃtraṃpraśasyate <1> pūrvapaṃktausamālekhyahrīṃ
kāraṃsmāṃtathaivaca tasyādhaḥsādhyanāmāthacatuḥkoṇenaveṣṭitaṃ  <2> koṇekoṇedalaṃkuryānmadhyadeśetathaivacadakṣiṇerodhabījāninairṛtekṣaṃtathaivaca <3> paścimestaṃbhabījānivāyavyekṣaṃtathaivacuttarekṣo
bhabījāni īśānekṣaṃtathaivaca <4> evaṃcāṣṭadalenyasyabījānidvādaśaivahi tamevasaṃpuṭesthāpyayaṃtrarājaṃjayā
vahaṃ <5> abhyarcyagaṃdhapuṣpādyairdīpaiścāṣṭabhirevaca lokapālāḥ susaṃpūjyābhojayitvākumārikāḥ<6> balidī
paiḥprapūjyāthacāṣṭadikṣukrameṇatu tāvatpūjyaṃprayatnenayāvatkāryaṃprasidhyati <7> vyavahārajayaṃnāmavivādavi
jayaṃtathā rājyekulavivādecajayaṃnāstyatrasaṃśayaḥ <8> mānonnatirbhavettasyayaṃtrarājaprasādataḥ itiśrīvaśīkara
ṇādhikārevivādavijayaṃnāmadaśamaṃyaṃtraṃśrīśivuvāca yadīchetsvavaśaṃkartuṃyāvajjīvaṃvarānane tadāyaṃtraṃ 
prakurvītagāṇapatyaṃsusiddhidam <1> bhūrjapatraṃsamānīyavistṛtaṃchidravarjitam anāmāraktasaṃmiśraṃdviradasya 
madaṃtathā <2> yāvakaṃ(lākha)carasaṃcaivarocanācatathaivaca evaṃcatuṣkaṃsaṃyojyajātīkāṣṭenavailikhet <3>hrīṃkārāḥsaptasaṃ
lekhyāḥ pūrvapaṃktauvarānane adhaḥpaṃktautusaṃlekhyaṃkroṃhrīṃklīṃgaṃtathaivaca <4> evaṃpaṃktaucaturthyāṃtuhrīṃkā

<pṛ03a> rāṇāṃcatuṣṭayam evaṃsaṃlikhyabījānidvāviṃśatisamānake <5> paścāttadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuḥkoṇaṃturekhayā gaṃkārāśasaṃlekhyāpūrvapaścima uttare <6>
kṛtvāmūrtiṃgaṇapateryaṃtraṃtasyodarekṣipet saṃpūjyagaṃdhapuṣpādyairimaṃmaṃtramudīrayet <7> devadevagaṇādhyakṣasurāsuranamaskṛta devadattaṃcamevaśyaṃyā
vajjīvaṃkuruprabho <8> imaṃmaṃtraṃsamuccāryahastamātraṃnikhanyaca kṣiptvātatragaṇādhyakṣaṃpūrayitvātumṛttikām <9> yāvajjīvaṃbhavedvaśyogaṇanāthaprasādataḥ
itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāregāṇapatyaṃnāmaikādaśaṃyaṃtraṃmekādaśamśrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyenavaśyakaraṃśubhaṃ madhyenāmalikhi
tvātuīkāraṃvilikhedbudhaḥ <1> trirāvṛttaṃtusaṃveṣṭyabhūrjapatresuvistṛte caturdalaṃlikhetpaścātpūrvādaudikcatuṣṭaye <2> oṃnamooṃnamolekhyaṃpaścimepūrvake 
dale oṃajiteoṃajitedakṣiṇecottarelikhet <3> janavaśyakaraṃnāmayaṃtrarājaṃmanoharaṃ tridinaṃpūjayennityaṃvrahmacaryaratonaraḥ <4> brāhmaṇaṃbhojayeccaikaṃ
caturthehanisubrataḥ trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābāhumadhyecadhārayet <5> haimaṃcarajataṃvāpipaṭṭasūtraṃviśeṣataḥ yaṃtraṃtudhārayecchreṣṭaṃbāhumūlegalethavā <6> sarveṣāṃ 
caivayaṃtrāṇāṃvidhireṣaprakīrtitaḥsubhagodarśanīyaścasvajanānāṃcavallabhaḥ<7>yaṃtrasyadhāraṇāddevibhavennāstyatrasaṃśayaḥ karpūrakuṃkumairlekhyaṃtathāgorocanenaca <8> 
itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārejanavaśyakaraṃnāmadvādaśaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvācajagadvaśyaṃmahāyaṃtraṃśṛṇudevisuśobhanaṃkarpūraṃmṛganābhiścacaṃdanaṃrocanātathā <1>
jātīkāṣṭenasaṃlekhyaṃbhūrjapatreviśeṣataḥ praṇavaṃcavakāraṃcaajehrīṃḍaṃcatathaivaca <2> pūrvapaṃktausamālekhyapraṇavādibījapaṃcakaṃdeḍaṃhrīṃcapraṇavaṃcikāracatathaivaca <3> 
dvitīyapaṃktausaṃlekhyavakāraṃtadanaṃtaraṃ ḍaṃkāraṃcajagannāmavakāraṃtadanaṃtaram<4> tadagrecalikhennūnaṃṭhakāraṃcacaturthakam dīkāraṃca 
tataścāṃteevaṃvaibījapaṃcakaṃ <5> evaṃbījānisaṃlekhyacatuṣkoṇaṃtusthāpayet dvirekhayāmahatkāryaṃjagadvaśyakaraṃparaṃ <6> triloha 
veṣṭitaṃkṛtvādhārayedbāhumadhyataḥ jagadvaśyaṃbhavettasyayaṃtraṃyāttutiṣṭati <7> saṃpūjyanityamevādauyaṃtraṃdevārcanādiṣu <8> iti 
śrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārejagadvaśyaṃnāmatrayodaśaṃyaṃtram śiva uvāca yadāsvabhṛtyaḥkruddhaḥsanmārgaṃsarvaṃprakāśate tadāta(-)
nmohanārthāyasvasyārthacasiddhaye <1>naśakyatenirākartuṃdeśakālabalenaca piśācikākhyaṃyaṃtraṃtukarttavyaṃcavicakṣaṇaiḥ <2> madhyenāma 
likhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ caturdalaṃprayatnenabījayuktaṃmanoharam <3> hrīṃkārāścaturolekhyādalamadhyecaturdiśam rocanā
bhūrjapatrecalekhinyāvilikhennaraḥ <4> tatastaddalamadhyetukṣipedrudreṇabhāṣitam <5> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārebhṛtyavaśyakaraṃnāmapiśācikā
khyaṃnāmacaturdaśaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca krūraprakṛtikaḥsvāmīyadāsaṃsevyatejanaiḥ sevyamānopihibhṛśaṃnadadātikadācana <1> khalaiḥparivṛtoni
tyaṃdurācāromahīpatiḥuttamovādhamovāpimlechovāprabhutāṃgataḥ <2> yaṃtraṃkālānalaṃkuryāttadvaśyesiddhikārakam sādhyanāmākṣa
rālekhyāgarbhahrīṃkāragāminaḥ <3> yāvaṃtaścākṣarānāmnitāvaṃtevahrīṃtathā īkāraścāṃtesaṃlekhyarocanābhūrjapatrake <4> trirāvṛ
ttacatuṣkoṇadīrgheṇaphalavatkṛtaṃ rājikāpratimāṃkuryāttatpādasyacapāṃsunā <5> prakṣipettasyatanmadhyeyaṃtraṃkālānalaṃmahat 
saṃpūjyapratimāṃtāṃtudhūlīpārśvenikhanyatu <6> prapūjayetprayatnenacaturdaśyāṃmahāniśi etatkaraṇamātreṇasavaśyojāyatedhruvam<7>ajāraktenasaṃmi
śraṃbhaktāṃpūpaṃtathaivacabalidānaṃpradātavyaṃdivyānāṃprītayesadā <8> oṃmahākālisvāhetijuhuyādaṣṭottaraṃśataṃ tadevabhaktaṃsājyaṃcaraktapuṣpaiḥsupūjitam <9> 
yaṃtraṃkālānalaṃnāmatridaśairapipūjitam <10> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārekrūravaśīkaraṇaṃkālānalaṃnāmapaṃcadaśaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca vāṇijyasya 

<pṛ03ba> tulābhārthaṃgatastannahidṛśyate teṣāṃmadhyeyadākopiduṣṭabhāvaṃkarotica <1> mārgadeśeprabhurvāpitadāyaṃtraṃprakalpayet hrīṃkāroda
ramadhyetusādhyanāmalikhennaraḥ <2> upariṣṭāccaturdikṣusvāhāṃtaṃpraṇavādikaṃ madhyeākarṣayalikheccaturdikṣukrameṇatu <3> paścāttadveṣṭa
yedyaṃtraṃcatuṣkoṇaṃdvirekhayā koṇekoṇetriśūlaudvaucaturdikṣuprakalpayet <4>evaṃyaṃtravaraṃkṛtvāpūjayitvāprayatnataḥ svaraktenatusaṃ
miśraṃrocanābhūrjapatrake <5> vilikhyakhaḍgavattaṃtukṛtvātaṃrahasikṣipettatkṣaṇājjāyatevaśyomahākrūrohimānavaḥ <6> itiśrīvaśīkara(-)
ṇādhikāreduṣṭavaśīkaraṇochiṣṭapiśācikaṃnāmaṣoḍaśaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca yadāmahābalaḥśatrurvārtāṃkartuṃhi 
vāṃchatitadātatsānukūlyārthaṃyaṃtraṃkurvītakaṃṭakam <1> sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyevarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥikāraścabhyakāraścavisargāṃtaścaturdiśaṃ ekaikādyaṃlikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥśmaśānabhasmanā
lekhyaṃcārkapatradvayopari <2> saṃpuṭaṃmela(kāra)yitvātuveṣṭayetkaṃṭakaistataḥnikhanyapūrayedyaṃtraṃśmaśāneniśipūjitaṃ <3>
balidānaṃpradāyātha(balipradānaṃkarttavyaṃ)bhūtehniprayatonaraḥ tatkṣaṇājjāyateśatruḥsānukūlonasaṃśayaḥ <4> kaṃṭakākhyaṃmahāyaṃtraṃduṣṭamohanakaṃparaṃ svaśaktyā
kṣiṇāṃdadyātkālarātriḥprīyatāmiti <5> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāreśatrusānukūlakaraṇaṃnāmasaptadaśaṃyaṃtraṃsamāptimagāt śrīśivuvāca suhṛdvā 
śatruvargovābaṃdhurvākrudhyateyaditadātatkopaśāṃtyarthaṃkuryādyaṃtraṃvicakṣaṇaḥ <1> madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥuparyadhaścottarecadakṣiṇecata
tathaivaca <2> biṃduvarjyaṃcaturdikṣuveṣṭayitvālikhennaraḥhūṃkāraṃtulikhedgarbhebiṃdumadhyeuparyadhaḥ <3> dakṣiṇecottarecaivasādhyanāmacapūrvavat 
aṃtehūṃkārasaṃyuktamadhaḥpaṃktauprasādaya <4> etadyaṃtraṃtusaṃlikhyatālapatresuvistṛte kaṃṭakenopasīvetavilikhetsomavāsare <5> kulālamṛtti
kāmadhyeyaṃtraṃkṣiptvātugolake kṛtvāpūjāṃprayatnenayasmātkaupaṃpraśāmyati <6> jāmadagnyaṃmahāmaṃtraṃsadyaḥkopaharaṃparaṃ akrodhanaḥsatyavādī 
jamadagnirdṛḍhavrataḥrāmasyajanakaḥ sākṣātsatyamūrtenamostute etanmaṃtraṃsamuccāryapūjāṃtenityamevahi <8> evaṃsaptadinaṃkāryaṃkrodhasyaharaṇaṃ 
param bhojanīyosaptamehnibrāhmaṇovedapāragaḥ <9> nocedannaṃpradātavyamāmamāhārapūrttaye krodhastuhṛdayādyātiprasannojāyatekṣaṇāt <10> 
itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārekrodhaśamanaṃnāmajāmadagnyamaṣṭādaśaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca ataḥparaṃdevibravīmitānidaurbhāgyahaṃtṝṇica 
kāminīnāṃ yaṃtrāṇisaubhāgyavivarddhanānisaṃmohanānipriyakāmukānām <1> ekapaṃktausamālikhyahrīṃkāratritayaṃśubhe tasyādhastātsamāle
khyaṃnāmavairamaṇasyaca<2>tataḥpaṃktautṛtīyāyāṃhrīṃkāratritayaṃpunaḥ tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃcarekhayā <3> tatastvaṣṭadalaṃkṛtvābījanyāsaṃpra
kalpayet koṇekoṇedalenyasyahrīṃkāraṃcavicakṣaṇaḥ <4> rocanākuṃkumenaivamṛganābhisucaṃdanam ekīkṛtyalikhedyaṃtraṃbhūrjapatesuvistṛte<5>trayo
daśyāṃsitepakṣesādhakaścottarāmukhaḥ tadyaṃtraṃpūjayennityaṃrātraurātrauvarānane <6> bhogairnānāvidhaiḥpuṣpairvastrālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ evaṃsaptadinaṃkṛtvā 
tadaṃtetavatuṣṭaye <7> striyaḥsaubhāgyasaṃyuktābhojayetsaptasaṃkhyayā śaṃkarasyapriyedevilaliteprīyatāmiti <8> rūpaṃdehiyaśodehisaubhāgyaṃde
himeṃbike śriyaṃdehibhagavativāṃchitaṃpriyamāyuṣam <9> etanmaṃtraṃsamuccāryatataścārghyaṃnivedayet tadyaṃtraṃdhātunāveṣṭyasvakaṃṭhedhārayettataḥ<10> 

<pṛ04a> subhagārūpasaṃpannāhyatipriyatarābhavet lalitākhyaṃmahāyaṃtraṃstrīṇāṃ saubhāgyakārakam <11> itivaśyādhikārestrīṇāṃsaubhāgyakārakaṃlali
tādaivatākaṃnāmaikonaviṃśaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca śṛṇudevipravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃbhartṛprasādanam saṃlikhyapriyanāmāthaśāṃkārapuṭitaṃśubhaṃ <1> 
uparyadhastathālekhyaṃśāṃkāradvitayaṃśubhaṃ tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagvarttulaṃrekhayaikayā <2> tasyoparidalānyaṣṭauhrīṃkārasahitaṃlikhet rocanākuṃku
menaivabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <3> tridinaṃpūjayennityaṃrātrautupūrvavatpriye tatonaktecaturthehnipūjayetsubhagātrayaṃ <4> anaṃgavallabhedevitvaṃmeśaṃprīyatāmiti 
etaṃpriyaṃmahāvaśyaṃkurutvaṃsmaravallabhe <5> etanmaṃtraṃsamuccāryapūjayitvātutāstriyaḥ tadyaṃtraṃdhātusaṃyuktaṃkṛtvākaṃṭhetudhārayet <6> patirdāsobhave
syāyaṃtrarājaprasādataḥ saubhāgyamatulaṃtasyājāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ <7> yāsāṃtāsāṃnadātavyaṃyaṃtraṃsaubhāgyavarddhanam <8> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhi
kāresaubhāgyakaraṃnāmaviṃśatikaṃyaṃtraṃsamāptimagāt śrīmahādevuvāca yoṣidvaśyaṃpravakṣyāmiśṛṇudevisuśobhanaṃ rocanākuṃkumenai
vaśrīkhaṃḍamṛganābhinā <1> bhūrjapatrecasaṃlekhyajātīkāṣṭenayaṃtrakam aiṃhrīṃklīṃcatatonāmaiṃhrīṃklīṃcatataḥpunaḥ <2> evaṃsaṃpuṭitaṃkṛtvācatuṣkoṇaṃ 
tuveṣṭayet uparyadholikhetpaṃcabījāniyatnataḥsudhīḥ<3> aiṃhrīṃklīṃcatataḥkṣāṃcaiṃtadaṃtepunastathā koṇevinyasyabījāniaiṃhrīṃklīṃcatathaivaca<4> 
dalākṛtiścakarttavyābījānyanuparikramāt evaṃcaturdalaṃkṛtvābījayuktaṃmanoharam  <5> rājikāpratimāṃkuryānmadanasyacakāṣṭake hṛditasyasu
saṃpūjyayaṃtraṃcasthāpayettataḥ <6> bhogaiścavividhairgaṃdhairdhūpairdīpaiḥphalaiḥśubhaiḥrātraurātraudināṃtecapratyahaṃpūjayecchubhe <7> evaṃkṛtetusānārīdāsīnū
naṃprajāyate yaṃtraṃśrīkāmarājākhyaṃyoṣidvaśyakaraṃparam <8> saṃpūjyomadanaścātrarājikāpratimānaraiḥ kāmonaṃgaḥpaṃcaśaraḥkaṃdarpomīnaketanaḥ<9> 
śrīviṣṇutanayodevaḥ prasannobhavameprabho itipūjanamaṃtraḥsyādasyakamalalocane <10> evaṃnityaṃcakarttavyaṃyāvatsāvaśyatāmiyāt saṃdehonātrakartta
vyitiprāhajanārdanaḥ <11> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikārestrīvaśīkaraṇaṃnāmakāmarājākhyamekaviṃśaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca śṛṇudevipravakṣyā
mimāninīmānamardanam yaṃtraṃsudurlabhaṃlokekhyātaṃmadanamardanam <1> turagasyacaraktenarocanābhūrjapatrake praṇavaṃcatathāhrīṃcasādhyanāmākṣaraṃpṛthak <2>
nāmākṣarāṇisarvāṇihrīṃkārapuṭitānica ādyaṃtepraṇavaṃlekhyamekapaṃktausubuddhitaḥ <3> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃturekhayā uparyadhaścasaṃlekhyapūrvava
dbījasaṃpuṭam <4> koṇedalākṛtiṃkuryānmardalākṛtimadhyataḥ etadyaṃtraṃsusaṃlikhyamadanapratimāṃśubhām <5> madanasyatukāṣṭenakṛtvāhṛdiviniḥkṣipet 
saraṃdhraṃhṛdayaṃkuryādyathāyaṃtraṃtutiṣṭati <6> saṃveṣṭyaprakṣipennūnaṃyaṃtraṃtasyorasisphuṭamraktacaṃdanamālyaiścapūjayetpratyahaṃcatat <7> itiśrīvaśīkara(-)
ṇādhikārestrīvaśīkaraṇaṃnāmamadanamardanaṃdvābiṃśaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmirājastrīvaśyakārakaṃyathātaddṛṣṭipātenakā
mabāṇahatāiva <1> pataṃtisahasādṛṣṭvāmānityomadavihvalāḥ rocanākuṃkumenaivabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <2> karpūreṇasamaṃyaṃtraṃjātīkāṣṭavidhāna
taḥ ṣaṭkoṇasyacamadhyetutasyānāmapratiṣṭitam <3> kroṃkāraḥsarvatolekhyaḥkoṇoparitusarvataḥ pūrvakoṇāṃtarāletuhrīṃkāraṃpūrvasaṃsthitam <4> tatsa
rvaṃveṣṭayetpaścādvarttulaṃrekhayāśubham dakṣiṇetridalaṃkuryāddhrīṃpratyekadaletathā <5> hrīṃkāraṃdalamadhyetukrameṇapratilekhayet evaṃ saṃlikhyata
dyaṃtraṃpūjayedbhaktibhāvataḥ <6> gaṃdhaiḥpuṣpaiḥsanaivedyaiḥśuklāṃbaradharaḥsvayam ciṃtayettāṃstriyaṃrātrauyaṃtrasyapurutaḥsthitaḥ<7>evaṃ saptadinaṃkṛtvātadaṃte 
brāhmaṇāstrayaḥ saṃbhojyāvividhairbhojyaiḥkāmākhyaḥprīyatāmiti <8> śaktyācadakṣiṇāṃdadyādbhojayetsādhakastriyam trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvā 
bāhumūlecadhārayet <9> taṃdṛṣṭārājaramaṇīkaṃdarpaśarapīḍitā svayaṃprārthayennityaṃkākathetarayoṣitām <10> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāretṛtīya 
yapīṭhikāyāṃrājāṃganāvaśyakaraṃkāmākhyaṃtrayoviṃśaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīmahādevuvāca ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmibījamekaṃmahāphalam tadyodhārayatenityaṃ 
strīṇāṃpriyatarobhavet <1> strīceddhārayatebhaktyāsāsaubhāgyavatībhavet saubhāgyajananaṃbījaṃnṛṇāṃcaivaviśeṣataḥ <2> taddhibījākṣaraṃgopyaṃnadeyaṃyasyakasyacit 
uḍīśe strīvaśīkaraṇaṃśvetaguṃjāṃpuṣyanakṣatresaṃgṛhyagorocanayākuṃkumenasahādityavāretilakaṃkārayettadākāmabāṇamohitāvihvalābhavati 
tilakamanenamaṃtreṇamaṃtritaṃkuryāt oṃaiṃhrāṃhrīṃhruṃphaṭsvāhā itikāmabāṇatilakam 

<pṛ04ba> sakāraṃcahakāraṃcavakāraṃcatathaivaca lakāraṃcikāraṃcīkārāṃtapratiṣṭhitam evaṃkrameṇasaṃyojyaṣaṭkamakṣarasaṃgatam <4> īkārasvarasaṃyuktaṃbiṃdunopariśo
bhitam rocanānīrayuktenabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <5> tridinaṃpūjanaṃkṛtvātataḥsaṃveṣṭyahāṭakepuruṣobāhumūlecanārīhṛditathaivaca <6> dhārayedbījarājaṃtusphuṭaṃdaurbhā
gyanāśanaṃmahāsaubhāgyajananaṃśrīśivenapratiṣṭhitam <7> itiśrīvaśīkaraṇādhikāretṛtīyapīṭhikāyāṃsaubhāgyajananaṃnāmacaturviṃśaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥ 
saṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃsaubhāgyadāyakaṃ strīṇāmevasamuddiṣṭaṃyaṃtraṃkamalasaṃjñakam <1> asyaivadhāraṇāddevivaṃdhyāgarbhavatībhavet mṛtvatsātuyānārītasyāstadyaṃtramuttamam <2> dhāra
ṇājjāyatedevijīvatputrānasaṃśayaḥrocanākuṃkumenaivabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <3> praṇavaṃtulikhetpūrvaṃhrīṃkāraṃtadanaṃtaram tatoramaṇanāmāpihrīṃkārāṃtaṃpratiṣṭhitam <4> upa
ryadhopivilikhedekaṃkroṃkāramevaca tatastadveṣṭayetsarvaṃvarttulaṃrekhayāpunaḥ <5> tasyoparidalānyaṣṭaubījākṣarayutānicahraṃkāraṃcaturdikṣudalamadhyetuvinyaset <6> oṃ 
kāṃcatathāhrīṃcajuṃkāraṃcatathaivaca hrīṃkāraṃcapunarlekhyamevaṃbījacatuṣṭayam <7> koṇekoṇedalaṃlekhyaṃmadhyadeśetusādhakaḥ evaṃyaṃtraṃsusaṃlekhyapūjayeccadinatrayam <8> 
bhojayenmithunaṃcaikaṃlokeśaḥprīyatāmiti paścāttutaṃtunāveṣṭyaṃsuvarṇenaviśeṣataḥ <9> varttulaṃmaṇivatkṛtvāhāramadhyetudhārayet dhāraṇājjāyatedevisaubhāgya
matulaṃmahat <10> jīvatputrābhavennūnaṃvaṃdhyacapraṇaśyati kamalākhyaṃmahāyaṃtraṃsṛṣṭaṃtubrahmaṇāpurā <11> nadeyaṃyasyakasyāpisādhakenavarānane itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtā
maṇaumahākalpepratyakṣasiddhipradeumāmaheśvarasaṃvādevaśīkaraṇādhikāredāmodarapaṃḍitoddhṛtetṛtīyapīṭhikāyāṃkamalākhyaṃpaṃcaviṃśatitamaṃyaṃtraṃśrīśivuvāca 
[itivaśīkaraṇādhikāraḥsamāptaḥ] [athākarṣaṇādhikāraḥ] jayatijagadaśeṣaṃdyotayandivyamāsānviśadakiraṇakāṃtiḥ prasphuraccaṃdramauliḥ viṣaviṣamama
hāhiprollasaccāruhāsaḥsatatamamitatejājñāmūrttirmaheśaḥ <1> ciṃtāmaṇaukalpavarecaturtheprārabhyatesaṃpratipīṭhikeyam ākṛṣṭiyaṃtrāṇiparisphuṭā
nivicārayāmītitupīṭhikāyām <2> saṃlikhyanāmabhūrjapatramadhyegorocanākarṣaticaturarṇān sakārabījānsavisargayuktāntasyopariṣṭhāhi 
likheccayaṃtram <3> īṃkāramadhyeviniveśyayasmādvisargayuktautulikhetsakārau kroṃhrīṃtathākroṃcavilikhyapaṃktauvarṇasyapaṃktiṃmahatākrameṇa <4> evaṃdvipaṃktau 
cavilikhyapaścānnāmnastumadhyevilikheccapaṃktim hrīṃkroṃtathāhrīṃcatathaivakroṃcavilikhyanāmnastuhyadhovibhāge <5> hrīṃkroṃtathāhrīṃcavilikhyapaṃktautasyā
pyadhovaivilikhettubījakau dakārarephautuvilikhyapaścātsaṃveṣṭayettriḥpariveṣṭanena <6> saṃpūjyayaṃtraṃvidhivaccapaścātsūtreṇasaṃveṣṭyasupāṃḍureṇa udvarttanenasva
śarīrajenavidhāyamūrtiṃmanujasyanūnam <7> vidhāyatasyāhṛdiyaṃtrarājaṃvidhāyacodvarttakenapaścāt saṃtāpayettāṃkhadirasyavahninādinatrayaṃmaṃtravaraiḥtrisaṃdhyaṃ <8> 
athatāpamaṃtraḥ devadattaṃvegenākarṣayamaṇibhadrasvāhā evaṃkṛtekarṣatimāṇibhadrodeśāṃtarasthaṃmanujaṃcanūnam atyaṃtadūrasthamapikrameṇasamānayedyaṃtra
varohinūnam <9> evaṃsupūjitaḥsadyaśodhanānapyākarṣatimāṇibhadraḥ itiśrīākarṣaṇādhikārecaturthapīṭhikāyāṃmāṇibhadrākhyaṃākarṣaṇaṃnāmaprathamaṃyaṃtram 
śrīmahādevuvāca ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃmitrasyadarśanaṃ raktacaṃdanenānāmikāraktenamiśraṃvaibhūrjapatrake <1> madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥcaturdalaṃta
taḥkuryādbījayuktaṃmanoharaṃ <2> hūṃkāraṃdalamadhyetupratyekaṃvilikhetkramāt evaṃyaṃtraṃsusaṃpūjyabalipuṣpairmanoharaiḥ <3> prakṣipeddhṛtamadhyetuhyākṛṣṭistridinādbhavet etadyaṃ
traṃmahāgopyaṃrakṣaṇīyaṃprayatnataḥ nadeyaṃyasyakasyāpiyadīcchetsiddhimātmanaḥ <4> itiśrīākarṣaṇādhikārecaturthapīṭhikāyāṃmitradarśanaṃnāmadvitīyaṃ
yaṃtra śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃtraipūrakaṃmahat rocanānīrayuktenabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <1> madhyenāmalikhitvātuhrīṃkārapuṭitaṃśubhaṃ 
ṣaṭkoṇaṃtulikhetpaścānnāmagarbhaṃmanoharam<2>sauṃkārānvilikhetkoṇemadhyatobiṃdubhūṣitam etadyaṃtraṃsusaṃpūjyaghṛtamadhyeviniḥkṣipet <3> pratyahaṃpūja
yennityaṃprārthayettripurāṃpunaḥākarṣayamahāvegāddevadattaṃmamapriyam <4> aiṃtripuredeveśitubhyaṃdāsyāmiyācitam prārthayanmaṃtreṇānenatripurāyaṃtraṃprapūjayet <5> 

<pṛ05a> evaṃkṛtesaptamehni hyākṛṣṭirjāyateśubhe <6> itiśrīākarṣaṇādhikāretraipuraṃnāmākarṣaṇayaṃtraṃtṛtīyaṃ śrīmahādevuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmikāminyākarṣaṇaṃśubham rahasyaṃsarvayaṃtrāṇāṃtatkṣaṇātsiddhidāyakam <1> nadeyaṃyasyakasyāpiyaṃtrarājaṃsudu
ṣkaram svānāmikāyāraktenavāmekaratalelikhet <2> praṇavaṃcatathāklīṃklīṃhyekapaṃktaulikhennaraḥ tisvāhātritayaṃcaivatasyādhovili
khetkramāt <3> tasyāpyadholikhennāmaramaṇyāścaivasubratetrikoṇaṃveṣṭayetpaścādbījānāmuparipriye <4> evaṃkṛtvātusaṃpūjyatatraivakusumaiḥśubhaiḥ 
yāmamātreṇasānārīsamāyātinasaṃśayaḥ <5> yaṃtraṃśrīkāmarājākhyaṃdevānāmapidurlabham <6> itiśrīlalanākṛṣṭikāmarājākhyaṃcaturthaṃyaṃtram 
śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃvaidevamātrikam karṣaṇaṃnaranārīṇāṃśṛṇudevimahatphalam <1> lākṣārasaṃharidrācamaṃjiṣṭaṃ 
bhūrjapatrakelekhanīyaṃprayatnenaikākināyaṃtramuttamam <2> madhyenāmalikhitvātutrikoṇaṃveṣṭayettataḥ taccāpiveṣṭayetpaścādvartulaṃyatnataḥpriye <3>
tasyoparisvarālekhyākārādyāstuṣoḍaśatatastadveṣṭayetsarvaṃrekhayānetrasaṃkhyayā <4> tasyaivapādadhūlyāthaprakuryācchālabhañjikām tasyā 
yaunautusaṃlikhyayaṃtrarājaṃprapūjitam <5> evaṃkṛtetusākṛṣṭāsamāyātinasaṃśayaḥ bahunātrakimuktenapatyaivasahacānayet <6> yaṃtrarājomahāgopyo 
devamātṛkasaṃjñakaḥ <7> 
itiśrīākarṣaṇādhikāremāninīākarṣaṇaṃdevamātrikasaṃjñaṃpaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃsamāptākarṣaṇādhikāraḥ ciṃtāmaṇaukalpavarasuyaṃ
treśrīcaṃdracūḍasyamukhādvinirgate tasmiṃścaturthīkilapīṭhikāmimāṃcakāradāmodaravipravaryaḥ <1> ākarṣaṇaṃnāmamahādhikāraṃpūrṇaṃtṛ
tīyaṃhimahāprabhāvam paṃcaivayaṃtrāṇimahāprabhāvarahasyabhūtānitukīrtitāni <2> nārāyaṇīmitigadaṃtisadaivalokāyāṃviśvamātarami
tipravadaṃtikecit gaṃdharvasiddhasurayakṣagaṇaistutāṃtāṃviśveśvarīmabhayadāṃtriguṇāṃnamāmi <3> saṃstaṃbhanaṃnāmamahādhikāraṃvicāra
yāmotratupīṭhikāyām yaṃtrāṇibījāniśṛṇuṣvadevisaṃstaṃbhanānikṣaṇasiddhidāni <4> śrīśivuvāca śṛṇudevimahāyaṃtraṃstaṃbha
naṃsarvavairiṇām vivādevyavahārāṇāṃmukhastaṃbhobhaveddhruvam <1> yadākālavaśāddevikalahaḥsaṃprajāyate tadākuryānmahāyaṃtraṃjihvāve
dhanakaṃparam <2> rocanābhūrjapatreṇasaṃlekhyaṃsuvicakṣaṇaiḥ ṣaṭkoṇāṣṭakaṃprakurvītarekhādvitayakenatu koṣṭamadhyelikhedbījaṃpratyekame
kamekakam hakāraṃcamakāraṃcalakāraṃtadanaṃtaram <4> vakāraṃcṛkāraṃcayakārāṃtaṃpratiṣṭhitam ūkārasvarasaṃyuktaṃmastakerephabhūṣitam<5> 
biṃdumātrārddhasaṃyuktaṃkoṣṭakevarṇaṣaṭkakam svaradvitayasaṃyuktaṃbiṃdunoparibhūṣitam <6> evaṃsaṃjāyatebījaṃmukhastaṃbhanamuttamam 
koṣṭekoṣṭetusaṃlekhyamekaikaṃbījamuttamam <7> evaṃbījānilekhyānirekhādvitayakenatu bījoparigatāḥkṛtvākoṇadeśāścaturdiśam <8> 
bāhyarekhorddhādholekhyāstriśūlāmastakopari sarvatrarekhayācāṃtetriśūlānilikhetkramāt <9> ṭhaṃkārabījāniṣaḍaivacordhvamadhopi 
tāvaṃtilikheccanūnam digdakṣiṇasyāṃcatathātribījaṃyāvaṃtisaṃkhyānitathaivacottare <10> śrīsūryasaṃjñānivilikhyapaścātsaṃpū
jyayaṃtraṃvidhivatprayatnāt japeccamaṃtraṃmanasāsuniścalatathātrisaṃdhyaṃtridinaṃprayatnataḥ <11> athamaṃtraḥ harllūlastaṃbhayastaṃbhaya 
amukasyamukhaṃstaṃbhayastaṃbhayasvāhā aṣṭottaraśataṃjaptavyam saṃpūjayedyaṃtravaraṃtrisaṃdhyaṃpītaiḥsupuṣpaiḥkanakāvadātaiḥ evaṃkṛteśatruga
tiṃmatiṃcasaṃstabhayedyaṃtravarohinūnam <12> mūḍhomahāmūkivaprajāyategrastograheṇevaripurmahograḥ <13> itistaṃbhaneśatrumukhastaṃbhanaṃprathamaṃyaṃtram 

<pṛ05ba> śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyatraṃstaṃbhanamuttamam śilāpuṭesusaṃlekhyapītadravyeṇaśobhanam <1> rocanāharitālaṃcaharidrā 
camanaḥśilā kuṃkumenasamāyuktaṃpītadravyaṃpracakṣate <2> kuṃbhemohecabījānicaikapaṃktaulikhennaraḥ tasyāpyadholikhennā
mamohecāṃtepratiṣṭhitam <3> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃrekhayā koṇekoṇetriśūlaṃcamadhyemadhyetathaivaca <4> evamaṣṭatriśūlā
nikṛtvāyaṃtroparipriye saṃpūjyapīta(karṇikāraṃkuraṃṭhaṃcacaṃpakaṃsvarṇaketakī dhattūraṃpītavarṇaṃcanāgakesaramevaca grāhyāṇyetānipuṣpāṇiyathālābhaṃvarānane anyāni pītavarṇāninagrāhyāṇikadācana)kusumairyaṃtrarājaṃsuśobhanam <5> dhūpairdīpaścanaivedyairnānābhakṣasamanvitaiḥ evaṃsaṃpūjyata
dyaṃtraṃbhūmimadhyekṣipentataḥ<6> mṛdāpūryasamedeśeyaṃtrasyopariyatnataḥ gamanaṃstaṃbhayennūnaṃnātrakāryāvicāraṇā <7> yadyāropitabhāṃ
ḍopinayātyevapriyesadā <8> itiśrīstaṃbhanādhikāreyātrāstaṃbhanaṃnāmadvitīyaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca ataḥparaṃpra
vakṣyāmivāṇīstaṃbhanamuttamam prativādimukhastaṃbhayaṃtraṃkhyātaṃtubhūtale <1> pītadravyeṇasaṃlekhyaṃśilāsaṃpuṭamadhyataḥ 
madhyenāmalikhitvātutrikoṇaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagvarttulaṃrekhayāpunaḥ tasyoparidalānyaṣṭauprakurvīta 
tataḥparam <3> dalamadhyetusaṃlekhyaṃlakāraṃbiṃdubhūṣitam evaṃcāṣṭadalaṃlekhyaṃpūjayetkusumaiḥśubhaiḥ <4> pītavarṇaisupu(-)
ṣpaiścadīpairnaivedyakottamaiḥ brāhmaṇaṃbhojayeccaikaṃpāyasenaguḍenatu <5> tatonikhanyādbhūmautusthāpayetpūrvavatpriye vivādevya
vahārecacarcāyāṃśāstrakasyaca <6> prativādimukhastaṃbhojāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ etadyaṃtraṃmahādevisugopyaṃkathitaṃtvayi <7> iti 
paṃcamapīṭhikāyāṃtṛtīyādhikāreprativādimukhastaṃbhonāmatṛtīyaṃyaṃtraṃsamāptimagamat śrīmahādevuvāca ||
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiśatruvaktrasyamudraṇaṃ yadāsaṃjāyatevādaḥśatruṇāsahasubrate <1> tadāyaṃtraṃprakurvītasugamaṃkṣaṇa
siddhidam khaṭikayātusaṃlekhyaṃsvabhittauvegataḥpriye <2> madhyenāmalikhitvātuśatrostuvidhivattataḥ tasyoparisthitārekhā 
vasusaṃkhyāṣṭadikkramāt <3> rekhāṃtecatriśūlānilikheddevidigaṣṭake tatraivacasusaṃpūjyaśvetapuṣpaiḥphalaiḥśubhaiḥ <4> anyai
ścaśvetagaṃdhaiścaśvetavastrairmanoharaiḥ brāhmaṇaṃbhojayeccaikaṃśrīśivaḥprīyatāmiti <5> vivādevitsabhāyāṃcamukhastaṃbhaṃkaro
tyayam <6> itiśrīpaṃcamapīṭhikāyāṃstaṃbhanādhikāreprativādimukhastabhaṃnāmacaturthaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmivahnistaṃbhaṃmanoharam divyakāleprakurvītayaṃtrarājasuśobhanam <1> pītadravyeṇasaṃlekhyaṃbhūrjapatresuśobhane
sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyekroṃmlāṃmadhyaṃcasaṃpuṭam <2> uparyadhopivilikhetkroṃkāraṃsumanoharamtatastadveṣṭayeddevicatuṣkoṇaṃturekhayā <3> 
tasyoparicatuḥkoṇaṃprakurvītadvirekhayā koṇāṃtarālesaṃlekhyaṃlakārāṇāṃcabījakam <4> koṇāṃtetupṛthaglekhyautriśūlausarva
taḥpriye evamaṣṭatriśūlānivilikhyāthaprapūjayet <5> saṃpūjyabrāhmaṇobhojyoyaṃtraṃbhūmauviniḥkṣipet vahamānodakemārgemadhyeyaṃtraṃnidhāyaca<6> 
yāvadyātitadupariudakaṃvaravarṇinitāvadagnermahāstaṃbhojāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ <7> divyasaṃstabhanaṃnāmayaṃtraṃdevaiḥsupūjitam na deyaṃyasyakasyāpi 
yadīchetsiddhimātmanaḥ <8> itiśrīpaṃcamapīṭhikāyāṃdivyāgnistaṃbhanaṃnāmapaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīmahādevuvāca śṛṇudevipravakṣyā

<pṛ06a> miyaṃtraṃvahninivāraṇam yasmingṛhestitadyaṃtraṃnatadāgnibhayaṃkvacit <1> yasyagṛhesadātiṣṭedyaṃtrarājomanoharaḥ svapnepyagnibhayaṃta
syakadācinnopajāyate <2>balātkāreṇakartavyamagnigrahaṇakaṃpriye vidyamānetathāyaṃtrepyauṣadhevābalādhike <3> pādaspṛṣṭoyathāsarpodaśatyeva 
nasaṃśayaḥ tathāstaṃbhopideveśibalātkāreṇavājanaiḥ <4> apamṛtyuṃyathādeviviharedvaidyakorasaḥ tathāyaṃtropideveśistaṃbhatenātrasaṃśayaḥ <5> śrī
khaṃḍarocananiśākhyasukuṃkumenasubhūrjapatrevidhivatsuvistṛte nāmasvakīyaṃtuvilikhyamadhyesuveṣṭayedvarttularekhayātathā <6> caturdalaṃrekha(-)
yācaabhitaḥparilekhayet vakāraṃbiṃdusaṃyuktaṃpūrvāparodagdakṣiṇe<7>athavāgṛhamadhyetukṣīramadhyethavāpunaḥ saṃpūjya 
nityamevedaṃdevadevaṃtuyaṃtrakaṃ <8> agneḥsakāśādyābhītiḥsadātasyanajāyate brāhmaṇaṃbhojayeccaikaṃyaṃtrarājasyatuṣṭaye <9> 
itiśrīpaṃcamapīṭhikāyāṃstaṃbhanādhikāregnistaṃbhanaṃnāmaṣaṣṭhaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmipriyasaṃstaṃbhanaṃparaṃ 
yadākopaṃvaroyātivāritopivarānane <1> tadātatstaṃbhanārthāyayaṃtraṃkuryātsuvistaram pītadravyeṇasaṃlekhyaṃphalakekāṣṭasaṃbhave <2> ||
sphāṭikaṃvābhavedyaṃtraṃphalakesphaṭikodbhave lakāragarbhamadhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭhitam <3> tatastadveṣṭayesamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃturekhayā tasyo
paricatuṣkoṇaṃdvitīyaṃtulikhedbudhaḥ<4>koṇedalākṛtiṃkuryānmadhyadeśepṛthakpṛthak dalamadhyelakāraṃtubiṃduyuktaṃlikhetpriye <5> evaṃ 
vilikhyasaṃpūjyavidhivadyaṃtramuttamam adhomukhaṃnidhāyāthaphalakaṃgṛhamadhyataḥ <6> tāvatstaṃbhobhaveddevinātrakāryāvicāraṇā
tathāpigachatastasyagatvācāpinivartate <7> itiśrīpaṃcamapīṭhikāyāṃstaṃbhanādhikārepriyayātrāstaṃbhanaṃnāmaṣaṣṭaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmivairivākstaṃbhanaṃparam khaṭikayāsusaṃlekhyaṃśilāsaṃpuṭamadhyagaṃ <1>hrīṃkāragarbhamadhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭhitam 
tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃtrirekhayā <2> tasyoparicatuṣkoṇaṃlikhitvāyaṃtrakaṃparam aṃtyakoṇetriśūlānicaturdikṣucatuścatuḥ<3> 
vilikhyapūjayedyaṃtraṃvidhivatkusumaiḥśubhaiḥsaṃpuṭelekhayitvātusthāpayedyaṃtrakaṃśubham<4>tatkṣaṇājjāyateśatrormukhastaṃbhaṃ 
nasaṃśayaḥbrāhmaṇaṃbhojayeccaikaṃśivomeprīyatāmiti<5> itiśrīstaṃbhanādhikāreśatrumukhastaṃbhanaṃnāmasaptamaṃyaṃtram 
śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃpiśunamudraṇam yadānijakuledevipiśunaḥkopivābhavet <1> tadāyaṃtraṃpra
vakṣyāmiśubhaṃpiśunamudraṇam śatrostaṃbhayatevācaṃgatiṃbuddhiṃvarānane <2> rocanābhūrjapatreṇalikhedyaṃtraṃsuśobhanaṃ kroṃ
kārapuṭitaṃkuryādakṣaraṃnāmasaṃbhavam <3> hrīṃkārapuṭitaṃpaścāddvitīyamakṣaraṃpunaḥ nāmākṣarāṇiyāvaṃtitāvatsaṃpuṭitānica <4> 
tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuḥkoṇaṃturekhayā koṇekoṇedalaṃkuryāddīrghabījenasaṃyutam <5> yakāraṃcamakāraṃcarakāraṃcatathaiva 
ca vakāraṃcikāraṃcayakāraṃtadanaṃtaram evaṃkrameṇasaṃyojyaakṣarāṇāṃcaṣaṭkakam ukāreṇasusaṃyuktaṃmastakerephabhūṣitam <7> 
biṃdunācasamāyuktaṃvilikheddalamadhyataḥ evaṃcaturdalaṃlikhyabījaṃvaisurapūjitam <8> dalāṃtarālesaṃlikhyakroṃkṣaścaivacaturdiśam 
evaṃsaṃlikhyayaṃtraṃcapūjayedraktacaṃdanaiḥ <9> raktapuṣpaistathāvastraiḥsvaraktenacasuṃdari yathāśaktyāpradātavyādakṣiṇātāmrasaṃbhavā <10>

<pṛ07a> śmaśānakarpaṭelekhyaṃlekhinyākākapiṃchayā <1> meṣasyarudhireṇaivadṛṣṭvāṃgāraṃśmaśānajam sādhyanāmalikhitvātutrikoṇaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2> 
adhoparicaraudvaudvausaṃlikhedbhūtarātriṣutatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuḥkoṇaṃturekhayā <3> koṇekoṇetriśūlānisaṃlekhyānicaturdiśam caturdi
kṣusanmukhaṃcacaturdaloparisthitam <4> evaṃsaṃlikhyayaṃtraṃtupūjayedvidhivatpunaḥsaptāṃgulaṃnikhanyāthapūrayedbhūmimadhyataḥ <5> yātrāsthitovā 
mārgasthoyaṃtraṃcākṣipyatetataḥparasparaṃmahādveṣobaṃdhūnāṃjāyatepriye <6> likhedvāpādapepatresopidaurbhāgyabhājanaḥ jāyatenātrasaṃdeho 
yaṃtrarājaprasādataḥ <7> itiśrīvidveṣaṇādhikārebaṃdhuvidveṣaṇaṃnāmatṛtīyaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmividveṣaṃsvāmibhṛtyayoḥ
vidveṣiraktamiśreṇalekhinyākākapiṃchayā <1> śmaśānakarpaṭelekhyaṃcaturdaśyāṃmahāniśi sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyevartulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2>ta
syoparihyadhobhāgerakāratritayaṃpunaḥ yaḥkārasaṃpuṭelekhyaṃtiryagbhāgaitripūjakam <3> makāraṃcayakāraṃcavisargāṃtaṃpratiṣṭhitam evaṃsaṃli
khyayaṃtraṃtuvarttulaṃveṣṭayetpunaḥ <4> evaṃyaṃtraṃsusaṃlikhyateṣāṃmārgenikhanyaca saṃjāyatemahādveṣosvāmisevakayoḥsadā <5> yāvadyaṃtraṃtubhū
misthaṃtāvaddveṣaḥpravarttate itikṛtvābhavedvairaṃsvāmisevakayorbhṛśam<6> itiśrīvidveṣaṇādhikāresvāmibhṛtyavidveṣaṇaṃnāmacaturthaṃyaṃtram ||
śrīśivuvāca śṛṇudevipravakṣyāmijagaddveṣakaraṃparam yaṃtraṃbhayānakaṃnāmadaurbhāgyasyacavarddhanam <1>kākollūkasyaraktenanarara
ktenavāpunaḥ ṛturaktenavāpunaḥdaurbhāgyaṃlalanāyāścalekhinyākākapiṃchayā <2> vilikhedbhūrjapatreṣusādhyanāmaniśipriye ||
kṛṣṇāṣṭamyāṃcaturdaśyāṃlikhedyaṃtraṃmanoharam <3> sādhyanāmalikhedmadhyeṭhakārapariveṣṭitam ṭhakārā
ṇāṃnasaṃkhyāstiviṣamairveṣṭayetsadā <4> tatastuvarttulaṃveṣṭyaṃdurbhagobhavaveṣṭayet etadyaṃtraṃsusaṃsthāpyata
dgṛhetṛṇamadhyataḥ <5> yāvadgṛhasthaṃtadyaṃtraṃsopitadgṛhagastadātāvaddveṣopyasyaśatrorjāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ<6> 
pūjākramaścapūrvoktaḥsoyaṃdevitṛṇaṃsadā <7> itiśrīṣaṣṭapīṭhikāyāṃjagaddveṣaṇaṃnāmapaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃ 
śrīśivuvāca itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauṣaṣṭīpīṭhikāsamāptā ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃśatrostumā
raṇam etadyaṃtraṃtusaṃlekhyaṃkapālecanarasyaca <1> śmaśānecaivasaṃlekhyaṃcaturdaśyāṃmahāniśi ekākināvi
vastreṇalekhyaṃniḥśaṃkinātathā <2> madhyenāmalikhitvātanmlimlitathopari adhopimlimlibījetuvi
lekhyausādhanenatu <3> trikoṇaṃveṣṭayetpaścādrekhādvitayaśobhitam ūrdhvarekhāstukarttavyāḥsarvatrāpiva
rānane <4> śarāvasaṃpuṭekṣiptvāyaṃtraṃtatraprapūjayet balimāṃsomāṃsopahāraiścasvaraktenaviśeṣataḥ <5> etadyaṃtraṃtu 
tatraivanikhanyāthaprapūjayet ekaṃcājabaliṃdadyāduddhṛtetupunaḥsukhī <6> nocedyamapurīṃyātinātrakā
nātrakāryāvicāraṇā itiśrīśatrumāraṇaṃprathamaṃyaṃtram śivuvāca 

<pṛ07ba> athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃprāṇavināśanaṃ māraṇaṃprabalasyāpiśatrormṛtyurnacānyathā haritālenabhūrjapatreviśeṣe
ṇalikhennaraḥ sādhyanāmalikhitvātulekhinyākākapiṃchayā hrīṃkāragarbhamadhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭhitam tatastadveṣṭayetsamyaktri
koṇaṃpūrvavatpunaḥ koṇekoṇetriśūlaṃtuvilikhyāthaprapūjayet pūjāvidhistupūrvoktaḥsarvatrāpicamāraṇe <4> narāṃghrinalikāmadhye 
kṣipedyaṃtraṃsupūjitam khātvāśmaśānabhūmautunalikācasuyaṃtrikā <5> akasmānmaraṇaṃtasyajāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ 
pūrvoktodurbhagobījaḥ sarvatrāpicamāraṇe itiśrīsaptamapīṭhikāyāṃśatrumāraṇaṃdvitīyaṃyaṃtram śivuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmimāraṇaṃdūradeśajam śmaśānāṃgārakaṃghṛṣyamajāraktaṃtathaivaca <1> viṣaṃcaivatusaṃghṛṣyali
khennarakapālake saṃpuṭaṃcaivasaṃlekhya lekhinyākāpiṃchayā <2> sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyehuṃkārapuṭitaṃśubham ta
taścāṣṭadalaṃkṛtvātanmadhyepitathaivaca <3> caturdiśitusaṃlekhyaṃhuṃphaṭcadalamadhyataḥ tatastadveṣṭayetsa
myagvarttulaṃtudvirekhayā <4> huṃkāraṃveṣṭayetpaścādviṣamaiḥsarvataḥpriye tatastatsaṃpuṭaṃkhātvāśmaśānepūrvavacchubhe <5> 
agnāvuparisaṃsthāpyapūjayitvāyathoditaṃ deśāṃtaragatasyāpiśatroḥsaṃjāyatejvaraḥ <6> pratyahaṃjvālanīyatu 
stokaṃstokaṃcasuṃdari yasmindinesarvadeśayagniḥprajvālyateniśi <7> tasminnevakṣaṇeśatrormāraṇaṃjāyate
priye <8> itiyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaumāraṇādhikāredūrasthaśatrormāraṇaṃnāmatṛtīyaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvācaathātaḥsaṃpra
vakṣyāmimāraṇaṃsarvadehināṃ rudhireṇamanuṣyasyaśmaśānāṃgāragharṣaṇaṃ <1> viśeṣeṇatathālekhyaṃkarpaṭevaiśmaśā
naje sādhyanāmalikhitvātuhuṃphaṭsaṃpuṭitaṃtathā <2> evaṃtrivāraṃsaṃlekhyaṃtripaṃktautuvarānane tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagvarttu
laṃtutrirekhayā <3> rājikīṃpratimāṃkuryācchatroścaraṇapāṃsunā taddhṛdmadhyeyaṃtrakaṃtukṣiptvātāpyaṃśanaiḥśanaiḥ <4> kra
meṇānenavaiśatrordāhaḥśokaścajāyate śirorukcaivamahatītṛtīyehniprajāyate <5> hastapādāṃgadāhaścamaraṇaṃsapta
mehani jāyatenātrasaṃdehovidhiḥpūrvonasaṃśayaḥ <6> itiśrīsarvajanamāraṇaṃnāmacaturthaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃstrīnaramāraṇaṃ vibhītakasyapatretughṛṣṭāṃgāraṃśmaśānajaṃ<1> ṛturaktenasaṃlekhyaṃlekhinyākā
kapiṃchayā sādhyanāmalikhenmadhyestaṃbhastaṃbhetisaṃmukham <2> tatastrikoṇaṃsaṃlikhyapaṃcakoṇaṃtatopari manuṣyana
likāmadhyekṣiptvāsaṃpūryamṛtsnayā <3> tanmūtrasiktayādevitatastatpūjyapūrayet bhuvomadhyenikhanyāthaśmaśāneprayatonaraḥ <4> 

<pṛ08a> tataḥsaṃjāyatedāhomṛtyuścaivakṣaṇādbhavet mṛyatesaptarātreṇamokṣaḥpūrvoktevahi <5> itimāraṇādhikārenaranārīmāraṇaṃnāmapaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃ 
śrīśivuvāca athuccāṭanādhikāraḥ athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiśatroruccāṭanaṃparaṃ anāmikāyāraktenasaṃlekhyaṃbhūrjapatrake<1> gāṇapatyā
nibījānilikheccapraṇavādikam ekapaṃktautusaṃlekhyaṃhuṃgaṃnāmatathaivaca<2> paṃktaudvitīyesaṃlekhyaṃtṛtīyevilikhettataḥ huṃgaṃdhaḥsvāhetica 
likhitvākramaśonaraḥ <3> tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuḥkoṇaṃdvirekhayā raktāṃbaradharodeviraktagaṃdhānulepanaḥ<4> caturdaśyāṃsādhakastumahārā
traulikhetkramāt pūjanaṃraktakusumairaktagaṃdhaiḥphalaiḥśubhaiḥ <5> kumārībhojanaṃrātrauyathāśaktyācadakṣiṇā dhyānaṃtudevadevasyagaṇanāthasyasuṃ
dari <6> nīlāṃjanābhaṃgajatuṃḍavaryaṃśatruṃgṛhītvānipuṣkareṇa utthāpayaṃtaṃgaganevicitraṃdhyāyettunityaṃvidhivanmanuṣyaḥ <7> uccāṭayatyeva 
nasaṃśayotradinetathaikādaśaviṃśakena ayaṃkramolekhanapūjanetusarvatratūccāṭakṛtādhikāre <8> khaṃḍaṃkṛtvāthatadyaṃtramucchiṣṭodanamiśritaṃ 
dīyatebhakṣaṇārthaṃcavāyasebhyodinedine <9> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau uccāṭanādhikāreprathamaṃuccāṭanayaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca 
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmihyūccāṭaṃsarvadehinām kākollūkasyaraktenabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <1> madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃ
veṣṭayettataḥcaturdalaṃtataḥkuryādrekhādvitayaśobhitam <2> dalamadhyeyakāraṃtuvisargāṃtaṃpratiṣṭhitam pūjākramastupūrvoktodhyā
naṃcaivavivarjitam <3> pūrvavadbhakṣaṇārthaṃcavāyasasyāṣṭamedine deśaṃsaṃtyajyayātyevagrāmasyaivatukākathā<4> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃ
tāmaṇauuccāṭanādhikāresarvoccāṭanaṃnāmadvitīyaṃtram śivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmisadyoccāṭanakaṃparam viṣeṇatāla
kenaivalikhetkākaṃtukarpaṭe<1>śmaśānecaivapūrvoktoyaṃtrasyatuvidhiḥsmṛtaḥadhomukhaṃtutaṃkākaṃlaṃbamānaṃtudakṣiṇe <2> vibhīta
kasyavṛkṣetubaṃdhayetprayatoniśi evaṃkṛtetṛtīyehnisthānāduccāṭanaṃbhavet <3> yāvadyaṃtraṃtutatrasthamudvignastāvadevahi naro 
categṛhaṃtasmaisukhaṃnalabhatekvacit <4> videśagamanetasyasaṃśayopicajīvane itiśrīsadyoccāṭanaṃnāmatṛtīyaṃyaṃtraṃśivuvā
ca ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmiśatroruccāṭanaṃparam niṃbapaṃcarasairlekhyaṃlekhinyākākapiṃchayā <1> bhūrjapatroparitathāvidhiḥpūrvoktameva 
hi madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2> caturdalaṃtataḥkuryādbījayuktaṃmanoharam ravauhitibījānidalamadhyepṛthak 
pṛthak <3> pūjyāthapūrvavatpaścānnikhanyāthaprapūjayet adhomukhaṃtutadyaṃtraṃpūrvoktavidhinātataḥ <4> evaṃkṛtesaptamehnimūccāṭa
yatinānyathā bhramatedeśadeśaṃcatṛṇavatparibhūyate <5> itiśrīuccāṭanādhikāreśatroruccāṭanaṃnāmacaturthaṃyaṃtraṃ śivuvāca 
śṛṇudevipravakṣyāmiyaṃtramuccāṭanaṃstriyaḥ gardabhasyaturaktenalekhinyākākapiṃchayā <1> phalaketulikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayetta
taḥ tataścāṣṭadalaṃkuryādbījayuktaṃmanoharam <2> khakāraṃsavisargāntaṃhrīṃkāraṃtadanaṃtaraṃ evaṃyaṃtraṃtusaṃlekhyapūjayitvāvidhā

<pṛ08ba> tataḥ nikhanyabhūmiṃsaṃpūryapūrvavaccāpyadhomukhaṃ evaṃkṛtetṛtīyehniśatroruccāṭanaṃbhavet <4> uccāṭayati 
sthānāccavāyustutṛṇapuṃjavat itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauuccāṭanādhikārenārīuccāṭanaṃnāmapaṃcamaṃyaṃtraṃ śivuvā
ca ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmitrailokyoccāṭanaṃparaṃkṛṣṇakukkuṭaraktenabhūrjapatrelikhennaraḥ <1> sādhyanāmalikhitvātutriko
ṇaṃveṣṭayettataḥpunastrikoṇaṃsaṃlekhyadvitīyaṃtuvarānane <2> tasyoparitribhāgetuhrīṃkārāṇāṃcatuṣṭayam evaṃtribhāgelekhyā
nibījāniravisaṃkhyayā <3> tatopivarttulaṃlekhyepūjayetpūrvavatpunaḥ evaṃkṛtvātutadyaṃtraṃbadhnīyācchvānakegale <4> yathāśvā 
bhramatenityaṃtathāsopivarānane <4> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇautryailokyoccāṭanaṃnāmaṣaṣṭhaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvācaa
thātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtramuccāṭanaṃparam niśācarai(haridrātarusaṃbhūtoguptanāmāniśācaraḥ tanmūlapatrasyarasairlekhyaṃtasyaivakaṃṭakaiḥ)rasaiḥkṛtvābījayuktaṃmanoharam <1> tataścalekhyaṃphaḍitipratyekaṃdala
madhyataḥ saṃpūjyavidhivatpaścādyaṃtraṃsaṃpūjayettataḥ khānepānepradātavyamuccāṭojāyatedhruvam<3> uccāṭanaṃnāmasaptamaṃyaṃ
traṃśrīśivuvāca [itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇāvuccāṭanādhikāraḥsamāptaḥ] [atharakṣādhikāraḥ] mahādevuvāca śṛ
ṇudevipravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃratnākarābhidham bālastrīpuruṣāṇāṃcamahārakṣākaraṃparam <1> kāṃsyapātrecasaṃlekhyaṃsuti
thauśobhanedine rocanākuṃkumenaivakarpūreṇaviśeṣataḥ <2> mṛganābhisusaṃyuktaṃ jātīkāṣṭelikhennaraḥūrdhveṣṭare
khāḥsaṃlikhyatiryagaṣṭautathaivaca <3> jāyaṃtekoṣṭakāḥsamyagekonapaṃcāśasaṃkhyayā akārādisvarālekhyāstiryagupa
rivaitathā <4> vyaṃjanāḥkramaśolekhyāstenaivakramataḥpriye evaṃsaṃlikhyabījānitriśūlānilikhettataḥ<5>pratirekho
rdhvatonūnaṃcaturdikṣukramāllikhet kroṃkārāḥṣaṭsusaṃlekhyāḥ pūrvecaivatupaścime <6> evaṃsaṃpūjyatadyaṃtraṃpūjayedbhaktiyogataḥpuṃḍarī
kaistathāṃbhojaiḥśatapatrairmanoharaiḥ <7> mālatībhiścajātībhirmallikāketakaistathā bakulaiścayathālābhaḥphalaiḥkālodbhavaiḥ 
śubhaiḥ <8> nirgaṃdhaṃraktavarṇaṃcapuṣpaṃyatnenavarjayet sakarpūraiścatāṃbūlairdhūpairgaṃdhaiḥsitāṃbaraiḥ <9> evaṃdinatrayaṃpūjyaṃnaivedyairvi
vidhaiḥpriye japetsaptaśatīṃnityaṃbrāhmaṇāṃstudinatrayam <10> saṃbhojyapāyasenaivayatheṣṭenaghṛtenaca tridinaṃbhūmiśāyī 
syādbhojayedbāṃdhavānpriye <11> uddhṛtyaguṭikāṃkṛtvātrilohairveṣṭayettataḥ taduccheṣaṃtupānīyaṃpānīyenavarānane <12> 
guṭikāṃkārayeddevibāhumūlegalethavā dhāraṇāttasyayaṃtrasyahyupasargaḥpraśāmyati <12> alakṣmīkalahaścaivadaurbhā
gyaṃcaviśeṣataḥ yatpareṇakṛtaṃkiṃcittatsarvaṃcapraṇaśyati <14> śāṃtikaṃpauṣṭikaṃnāmadevānāmapidurlabham prathamaṃyaṃ

<pṛ09a> trarājākhyaṃsadyaḥpratyayakārakam <15> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebālarakṣākaraṃnāmaprathamaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīmahādevuvāca śṛṇude
vipravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃcoranivāraṇaṃ sarpavyāghrabhayaṃnāstiyaṃtrekaratalesthite <1> lekhanaṃpūrvavidhinādravyaṃpūrvo
ktamevaca sarvatraśāṃtivividedhikohyanyonavidyate <2> pūjanaṃcaivapūrvoktaṃniyamaścāpitādṛśaḥbhūrjapatretusaṃ
lekhyaṃdvitīyaṃyaṃtramuttamam <3> hrīṃkāragarbhamadhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭitaṃ tatpādetususaṃyojyamakārastadanaṃ
taraṃ <4> lakāraṃcavakāraṃcayakārāṃtaṃpratiṣṭhitam īkārasvarasaṃyuktaṃśāṃtibījaṃmanoharam <5> tatastadveṣṭaye(-)
tsamyakcatuḥkoṇaṃdvirekhayā trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābāhumūletudhārayet <6> sarpavyāghrabhayaṃhaṃtima
hācorabhayaṃtathā vividhopadravānhaṃtinātrakāryāvicāraṇā <7> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇausarpavyāghraco
ranivāraṇaṃnāmadvitīyaṃtram śivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃdaurbhāgyanāśanaṃ nārīṇāṃcavi
śeṣeṇanarāṇāṃcaivasarvadā <1> lekhanaṃtuyathāproktaṃvidhiḥpūrvoktamevahi lekhanīpūrvanirdiṣṭābhūrjapa
trelikhennaraḥ <2> sādhyanāmalikhitvātutrikoṇaṃtudvirekhayā tasyoparicatuṣkoṇaṃrekhādvitayaśobhitaṃ<3> 
koṇekoṇetriśūlānipūrvoktavidhinātataḥ trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābāhumūlegalethavā <4> dhārayedvidhipū
rvaṃtunārīvāpuruṣothavā vividhopadravānhaṃtivaṃdhyāgarbhaṃcadhārayet <5> saubhāgyamatulaṃprāpyadevavanmo
datesadā <6> itiśrīśāṃtyadhikāresaubhāgyavarddhanaṃnāmatṛtīyaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca a
thātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmijvaranirnāśanaṃparaṃ bhūtajaṃtujvaraṃyattuvaidyakebhāṣitaṃmahat <1> yatnenacasadākāryaṃyaṃtraṃ 
vaijvaranāśane unmattasyarasairlekhyaṃkarpaṭevaiśmaśānaje <2> kṛṣṇāṣṭamyāṃcaturdaśyāṃsaṃpūjyanikhanettataḥ 
śmaśānetudivaivasyānnirahāraścamānavaḥ <3> turyoparicatuṣkoṇaṃyathācāṣṭadalaṃbhavet madhyenāma 
likhitvāturakārakṛtasaṃpuṭaṃ <4> dalamadhyetusaṃlekhyārakārābiṃdubhūṣitāḥ yāvatyastatrarekhāścasa
rvaṃtatrakrameṇatu <5> saṃpūjyabhūmiṃsaṃpūryabalipuṣpairmanoharaiḥ tatkṣaṇādyātitadbhūtajvaraṃcaivasudāruṇaṃ<6>
itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārejvaranāśanaṃnāmacaturthaṃyaṃtraṃ śivuvāca ataḥparaṃprava
kṣyāmibālānāṃśāṃtikārakaṃ yaṃtraṃrakṣākaraṃśreṣṭaṃsarvopadravanāśanam <1> pūrvoktavidhinālekhyaṃ 
dravyaiḥpūrvoditaiḥkramāt bhūrjapatroparilikhetpūrvoktavidhinārcanam <2> madhyenāmalikhitvātu 

<pṛ09ba> vartulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ tataścāṣṭadalaṃkāryaṃbījayuktaṃmanoharaṃ <2> sakārāḥ savisargāṃtādalepratyekaśonyaset saṃpūjyavidhivatpaścādbāhumū
legalethavā <3> dhārayedyaṃtrarājaṃtutrilohapariveṣṭitam śākinyovāthaḍākinyokūṣmāṃḍādyāstathāpare <4> gachaṃtibālakaṃtyaktvā
yaṃtrarājasyadhāraṇāt <5> itiyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebālarakṣākaraṃpaṃcamaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmitṛtī
yajvaranāśanam dravyaiḥpūrvoditairlekhyaṃbhūrjapatresuśobhane <1> madhyenāmalikhitvātuyakārasyacasaṃpuṭe trikoṇaṃveṣṭayitvātubījānivilikhettataḥ<2>
tasyādhaḥsvastikaḥkāryastatsarvaṃveṣṭayetpunaḥ catuṣkoṇaṃśikhākāraṃtasyoparilikhedbudhaḥ<3> yakārānsavisargāṃtānviṣamāṃstatrasaṃnyaset 
saṃpūjyatasyavelāyāṃbadhnīyāddakṣiṇekare <4> velājvarasyaśāṃtyarthaṃbalyarthaṃdadhibhaktakam bālovāpyathavāvṛddhojvarānmucyetatatkṣaṇāt <5>
jvaroyātinasaṃdehobhūtajastutṛtīyakaḥ rogajonaivayātyeṣanayojyastatrajānatā <6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇautṛtīyajvaranāśanaṃṣaṣṭaṃyaṃtram śrī
mahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmivelājvaravināśanaṃ pūrvoktavidhinālekhyaṃdravyaiḥpūrvoditaikramāt <1> bhūrjapatretusaṃlekhyaṃpūjayitvāvidhānataḥ 
madhyenāmalikhitvātuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ <2> ūrdhvodhastutathāpṛṣṭecakārasyatusaṃpuṭam tataścāṣṭadalaṃkāryaṃbījayuktaṃ 
casarvataḥ <3> pratyekaṃdalamadhyetunakāraṃbiṃdubhūṣitaṃ dalāṃtaretuhrīṃkārānaṣṭausarvatravinyaset <4> evaṃsaṃlikhyasaṃpūjyaśī
tatoyeviniḥkṣipet mucyatetridinādrogījvaradāhīnasaṃśayaḥ<5> uṣṇodaketusaṃkṣiptaṃjvaraḥśītovinaśyati hasta
mūletutadbaddhaṃjvarovelāsamudbhavaḥ <6> naśyatenātrasaṃdehastatkṣaṇātsurasuṃdari <7> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikā
revelājvaranāśanaṃnāmasaptamaṃyaṃtraṃ śivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyā mibālānāṃrakṣaṇaṃsadā yaṃtraṃjvalanarakṣārthaṃvāyuva
rddhanakaṃsadā <1> pūrvoktavidhinālekhyaṃsādhyaṃnāmatusādhakaḥ tatastadveṣṭayetsamyakcatuṣkoṇaṃdvirekhayā <2> tasyoparicatuṣkoṇaṃtriśū
lānkoṇatolikhet koṇāṃtetulikhedbījaṃṭhakāraṃbiṃdubhūṣitam <3> uparyadhopyaṃtarālehrīṃkārānvilikhedbudhaḥ evaṃsaṃlikhya 
tadyaṃtraṃpūjayitvāvidhānataḥ <4> trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābadhnīyātkaṃṭhamadhyataḥnacopasargikāḥkecidrogāḥśārīramānasāḥ <5> īrṣyā 
kopaṃtathārogāṃdaṃtānāṃsaṃbhavaḥkutaḥ nabādhatebālakasyastanyadoṣaḥkadācana <6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebālaka 
jvalanarakṣākhyaṃnāmāṣṭamaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmibhūtāpasmāranāśanam śākinībhūtavetālairgṛ
hītovāpidāruṇaiḥ <1> tadātanmocanārthāyayaṃtraṃkuryānmanoharam svasthastucetprakurvītasatudoṣairnagṛhyate <2> dravyaiḥpūrvodi
tairlekhyaṃpūrvoktavidhināpunaḥ madhyenāmalikhitvātubhūrjapatrevarānane <3> varttulaṃveṣṭayetsamyaktasyoparidalāṣṭakam hrīṃkā
raṃdalamadhyetupratyekaṃvilikhetpunaḥ <4> evaṃsaṃlikhyatadyaṃtraṃlohatritayaveṣṭitam suvarṇaṃrajataṃtāmraṃtrilohaṃparicakṣate <5>bā
lānāṃcagaledhāryaṃyaṃtraṃtripurabhairavam mucyatebālakorogairapasmārādibhiḥśubhe <6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārea
pasmāranivāraṇaṃnāmanavamaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmisarpasaṃrakṣaṇaṃparam sarpādibhirya

<pṛ010a> dābālaḥprauḍhovāpiśeṣataḥ <1> nadṛśyateyadādevipramādātphaṇināṃpatiḥ pūrvoktavidhinālekhyaṃpūjayitvāvidhānataḥ <2> madhyenāmalikhitvātu
varttulaṃcadvirekhayā saṃveṣṭyacadalānyaṣṭauhaṃsaḥbījayutānyapi <3> trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābāhumūlecadhārayet naśyaṃtidarśa
nāttasyadaṃdaśūkāścaturdiśam <4> pramādātpatitepādestaṃbhayennātrasaṃśayaḥ athadaṣṭaṃpramādenaviṣaṃnaivādhirohati <5> sarpāṇāṃ 
staṃbhanārthāyayaṃtraṃgaruḍabhāṣitam<6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikāresarpastaṃbhanaṃnāmadaśamaṃyaṃtraṃ śivuvāca 
ataḥparaṃpravakṣyāmiḍākinītrāsanaṃparam bhūtapretapiśācādyaiḥśākinībrahmarākṣasaiḥ<1> yadāgrastonaraḥkopinārīvābā
lakopivā tadāyaṃtraṃprakurvītatrāsārthaṃbhūtarakṣasāṃ <2> khaṭikayāsusaṃlekhyaṃkarpaṭenatubhūtale catasrastiryagrekhāścapaṃ
cahyūrdhvagatālikhet <3> evaṃtitekoṣṭādvādaśaivavarānane drīṃkāraṃpratikoṣṭaṃvaivilikhyāthaprapūjayet <4> balipuṣpopahārai
ścatatradīpaṃ(tadupari)prajvālayet saṃsthāpyacāgnāvuparijvālayetvadirānale <5> rudyamānomahābhūtovepamānaścagacchati ||
tatkṣaṇādbālakaṃmuktvādeśaṃtyaktvāsagacchati <6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebhūtatrāsanaṃnāmaikādaśaṃyaṃtram 
īśvaruvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmijvaranirnāśanaṃparam tāṃbūlapatresaṃlekhyaṃkauṇapasyatukaṃṭakaiḥ <1> sādhyanāmali
khitvātukroṃkārapuṭitaṃśubham ṣaṭkoṇasyatumadhyetupratyekaṃpraṇavaṃlikhet <2> koṇoparicadrīṃkāraṃsarvatovili
khetkramāt tāṃbūlabhakṣaṇārthaṃcapūjayitvāpradīyate <3> yaṃtrasyabhakṣaṇāddevijvaroyātinasaṃśayaḥ ekāṃtabhakṣa
ṇenaivanātrakāryāvicāraṇā <4> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhityadhikāreekāṃtarajvaranāśanaṃdvādaśaṃyaṃtram 
śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmigarbharakṣākaraṃparam gajamadenasaṃlekhyaṃbhūrjapatrevarānane <1> gajasya
tumadābhāvekuṃkumenapralekhayet madhyenāmalikhitvātucatuṣkauṇaṃdvirekhayā <2> saṃveṣṭyakarṇikākāryāvarttulā 
tucaturdiśam yakāraṃcarakāraṃcavisargāṃtaṃpṛthakpṛthak <3> karṇikāmadhyatolekhyaṃpūrvavatpūjayettataḥ lohakenatusaṃ
veṣṭyagarbhiṇyāḥkaṃṭhatonyaset <4> sukhaprasūtiścabhavecchūlachidraṃvinaśyati <5> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtya
dhikāregarbharakṣākaraṃtrayodaśaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmihyaṃtarvatnīsurakṣaṇam yaṃtraṃ
yonivyathāyāścavāraṇaṃsūtirakṣaṇam <1> pūrvoktavidhinālekhyaṃdravyaiḥpūrvoditaiḥkramāt bhūrjapatrevidhānenamadhya
deśevicakṣaṇaḥ <2> praṇavaṃcatathādrīṃcādyaṃtenāmatolikhet paṭavaccacatuṣkoṇaṃdīrghaṃsaṃveṣṭyarekhayā <3> uparya
dhopitridalaṃkoṇaikaikaṃpratiṣṭitam drīṃkṣūṃcatathādrīṃcakoṇedalagataṃlikhet <4> kroṃkāraṃtathāśrīṃcadalaśeṣu
vailikhet evaṃvilikhyasaṃpūjyalohatritayaveṣṭitam <5> garbhiṇyāḥkaṃṭhadeśetudhāryaṃyaṃtraṃnasaṃśayaḥ yoniśūlaṃ 

<pṛ010ba> śiraḥśūlaṃbhūtadoṣaṃpraṇaśyati <6> sukhaprasūtirbhavativyathāvarjaṃnasaṃśayaḥ yaṃtrarājaḥsamākhyātorahasyaḥśivabhā
ṣitaḥ <7> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikāregarbhiṇīsukhaprasūtikaraṃcaturdaśaṃyaṃtram śivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpra
vakṣyāmisarvarakṣākaraṃparam chalachidraharaṃnāmasarvatobhadramaṃḍalam <1> ūrdhvarekhāḥpaṃcapaṃcatiryagrekhāḥsusaṃlikhet koṣṭā
nśoḍaśasaṃkhyākāñjānīyāccaivavaibudhaḥ <2> akārapūrvānkramaśovilikhyasarvatrakoṣṭānniśibhūtajehni bhūrjasyapatremṛganā
bhicaṃdanaṃhimenasaṃmelyalikhetkrameṇa <3> saṃpūjyapuṣpairvividhaiścagaṃdhaidhūpairmanojñairvividhopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya viprānvasanairdhanaiśca
yaṃtraṃcatadbhaktiyutaḥsamarcayet <4> saṃveṣṭyalohatritayenayaścasaṃhṛṣṭacetāvidhivanmanuṣyaḥ taṃdhārayeddakṣiṇabāhumūle
nārīgaleyaṃtravaraṃprayatnāt <5> taddhāraṇātprāptamanaprasādaḥsarvapriyobhāgyayutasupūrṇaḥ saṃjāyatesarvabhayenahīnoloke
tathāprāptamahāṣṭasiddhiḥ <6> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikāresarvarakṣākaraṃsaubhāgyavardhanaṃnāmaśoḍaśaṃyaṃtraṃsamāpti
magāt śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃdyūtajayāvaham sarvadyūtejayaḥproktodhāraṇādyaṃtrakasyaca <1> vāji
nākramatālekhyaṃcatuṣṣaṣṭiścakoṣṭakam dhāraṇājjāyatedevijayaḥsarvatraniścitam <2>bhūrjapatretusaṃlekhyaṃlekhinyākā
kapiṃchayākajjalasyamaṣīṃkṛtvālikhedrātrauśucismite <3> tiryagūrdhvāstusaṃlekhyānavarekhāḥsuvistṛtāḥevaṃbhavaṃtiko
ṣṭāścacatuḥṣaṣṭivarānane <4> madhyebījānilekhyānyanulomapratilomataḥ punarlekhyānitānyevamanobuddhikrameṇatu <5> dāmodarakavīṃdreṇacitraṃvācaḥkramaḥkṛtaḥ
makheraktaṃdayetuṣṭākajinaṃtaṃdanīvinaḥ chaṃdādoyaṃmaṃtrajeṣaheṣṭivāmoktiṇāṃyātra <6> etānyevatubījānidvātriṃśadvili
khetkramāt dāmodarakavīṃdreṇatridhāvājikramaḥkṛtaḥ <7> svechayānīyateyenacatuṣṣaṣṭipadaṃjanaiḥ prasaṃgāttanmayā 
coktoyaṃtrarājomanoharaḥ <8> sarvadyūtajayaḥproktodhāraṇājjāyatedhruvam <9> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikā
redyūtajayanāmakaṃsaptadaśakaṃyaṃtraṃ śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmibaṃdhamokṣaṃmanoharaṃ
baddhoruddhaḥkṣaṇenaivamucyateyatprasādataḥ <1> yadākenāpisaṃruddhonaviṃdenmuktimātmanaḥ tadāyaṃ
traṃprakurvītatatkṣaṇānmuktidāyakam <2> karpūrakuṃkumenaivabhūrjapatreśucismite lekhanīyaṃprayatne
nacaikāṃteyaṃtramuttamam <3> madhyenāmalikhitvātuhṛllekhātadanaṃtaram tatastadveṣṭayetsamyagvarttulaṃ
tudvirekhayā <4> māṃmocayetisarvatracaturdikṣupraveṣṭayet catuṣkoṇaṃtusaṃveṣṭyarekhātritayakena
tu <5> pūjanīyaṃprayatnenagaṃdhaiḥpuṣpaiḥphalaiḥśubhaiḥ trilohaveṣṭitaṃkṛtvābāhumūlegalethavā <6> 

<pṛ011>> dhāraṇāttatkṣaṇānmuktaḥsaṃsārādivanirmamaḥ svasthatādhāraṇānnityamavarodhaḥkadāpina <7> jāyatenātrasaṃdehaḥsvapnepihikadācana
itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebaṃdhamokṣaṇaṃnāmāṣṭādaśaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmibavabaṃdhavi
nāśanam nirvāṇapadayogyaṃhinirvedapadadāyakam <1> ṣaṭkoṇasyatumadhyetusādhyanāmapratiṣṭitam niḥsārapu
ṭitaṃkṛtvābhūrjapatresuvistṛte <2> niḥsāraṃtulikhetkoṇerocanākuṃkumena(caṃdanena)ca saṃpūjyavidhivadyaṃtraṃsadbhaktiprayato
naraḥ <3> lohamadhyagataṃkṛtvādhārayechirasāsadā taddhāraṇātkrameṇaivaviraktaḥsaṃprajāyate <4> jñānayogaṃsamāsādyamu
cyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ putramitrakalatreṣunirmohaḥsaṃprajāyate <5> nirjanebhavaneraṇyedurgevāpattanegirau jāyatenātrasaṃde
hoyogīsarvatrapūjitaḥ <6> itiyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikārebhavamocanaṃnāmaikonaviṃśaṃyaṃtram śivuvāca athā
taḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiduṣṭasatvātpramocanam yadāraṇyesariddurgeduṣṭasatvaiścabādhitaḥ <1> tadāyaṃtraṃprakurvītavāmahastatalopari 
niṣṭhīvanenadrīṃkāraṃmanasāpūjayettadā <2> anāmodbhavaraktenacaturdikṣuprasiṃcayet tatkṣaṇānmucyatejaṃturyāvaddvīpimaho
ragaiḥ <3> ruddhovṛkaiścakaribhiranyairduṣṭairnasaṃśayaḥ<4> [itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇauśāṃtyadhikāreduṣṭasatvapramocanaṃnāmaviṃśati
tamaṃyaṃtram samāptaścāyaṃśāṃtyadhikāraḥ] [athabaṃdhamokṣādhikāraḥ] āpādamastakanibaddhajanāḥkṣaṇenamokṣaṃprayāṃti
nigaḍaiścasuveṣṭitāṃgāḥyasyājñayājagatidevamanuṣyasiddhāstāṃbhaktinamramanasāpraṇatosmivaṃdīm <1> adhikāraṃmahadvakṣye
vaṃdīmokṣakaraṃnṛṇām viśvāsāttatkṣaṇāddevisarvakāryaprasādhanam <2> śrīmahādevuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyā
mivaṃdīmokṣaprasādhanam yatprasādātkṣaṇenaivabaṃdhamokṣaḥprajāyate <1> sādhyanāmalikhitvātudrīṃkārāṃścaturolikhet tatastadveṣṭayetsamya
gvarttulaṃrekhayaikayā <2> apūpoparisaṃlekhyaṃghṛtenaivatuyaṃtrakam tatraivavividhaiḥpuṣpairnaivedyaiḥpūjayeccatat<3> bhakṣaṇārthaṃpradātavyamapūpaṃsura
suṃdari tridinānmucyatejaṃturdṛḍhabaddhopimucyate <4> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaumokṣaṇādhikārebaddhamocanaṃprathamaṃyaṃtram śivuvācaiṃ 
drīṃdrīṃdrīṃśrīṃśrīṃvaṃdīdevyaiamukasyabaṃdhamokṣaṃkurukurumātarnamaḥsvāhā anenamaṃtreṇanāmagṛhītvāpratimaṃtraṃgugguluṃcaṃḍikāṃpratihomaye
tsaptaviṃśatidināni āhutiḥ <108> pratidinaṃvāraṃvāraṃmaṃtrāhutiṃdatvāsaptaviṃśatidinaparyaṃtaṃmokṣobhavatinānyathāekamevayaṃtraṃvihitaṃsi
ddhaṃceddhomayet itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaumokṣādhikārebaṃdhādimokṣakaraṃnāmadvitīyaṃyaṃtram śrīmahādevuvāca 
athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃnigaḍamocanam hastapādagalebaddhomucyateyatprasādataḥ <1> kāṃsyapātroparilekhyaṃrocanācaṃdanenaca karpūrakuṃ
kumābhyāṃcamṛganābhiyutenaca <2> drīṃkāraṃmadhyadeśetuvarttulaṃveṣṭayettataḥ tatastuśoḍaṣadalamakārādisvarānvitam <3> tatastadveṣṭayesamya 

<pṛ012>> gvarttulaṃrekhayāpunaḥ tasyopariprakarttavyaṃdvātriṃśaddalasaṃyutam <4> kakārādisakārāṃtavyaṃjanānilikhetkramāt pratiṣṭhāpyamahāpū
jāṃgaṃdhapuṣpaiḥphalaiḥśubhaiḥ <5> naivedyairbalihomaiścadīpadānairmanoharaiḥ oṃnamaścaṃḍikāyaisvāhetiśatamaṣṭottaraṃhunet <6> pā
yasairmadhukhādyaiścaguggulaiścaviśeṣataḥ pratyahaṃtuprakarttavyaṃsaptamehanipūryate <7> uddhṛtyapayasaḥsarvaṃbhājanādgaṃdharoca
nām pānārthamathadātavyaṃguṭikārddhaṃnakalpayet <8> taddhāraṇātpramucyetacirabaddhopimānavaḥ <9> itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaubaṃ
dhamokṣādhikārenigaḍamokṣaṇaṃnāmadvitīyaṃyaṃtram śrīśivuvāca athātaḥsaṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃtraṃvaibaṃdhamocanam vivarecāpi
saṃruddhomucyateyatprasādataḥ <1> drīṃkāraṃmadhyadeśetusādhyanāmnastusaṃlikhet likhitvābhūrjapatreturocanākuṃkumenaca <2>
tadyaṃtraṃpūjayitvātuvahamānāṃbhasikṣipet tadaṃbhaḥpakvenānnenabhojanaṃtasyakārayet <3> evaṃkṛtetṛtīyehnimucyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ 
vivarasthovaruddhoyogūḍhasthopivimucyate <4> [itiśrīyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaumokṣādhikāresaptamapīṭhikāyāṃgūḍhamocanaṃnāmatṛtīyaṃ
yaṃtram samāptaścāyaṃmokṣādhikāraḥ] yaṃtraciṃtāmaṇiṃnāmakalpaṃśrīśivabhāṣitam dharmārthakāmaphaladaṃvairipakṣavināśanam <1> 
yastupūjayatenityaṃdhārayedvāpimānavaḥ adhṛṣyaḥsarvalokānāṃjāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ <2> śṛṇotiyastudharmātmāvācyamānaṃnaraḥsa
dā sopipūjyaścamānyaścajāyatenātrasaṃśayaḥ <3> yaṃtraciṃtāmaṇiṃśrutvāyasyaśraddhānajāyate sadaṃḍaḥpāpakṛddveṣīdurbhagobhuviniści
tam <4> yastuśraddhābhiyuktaḥsanyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇiṃśrayet tenasārddhaṃtukaḥkuryādvirodhaṃvaijijīviṣuḥ <5> ataḥparaṃkiṃbahunoditenaka
lpaprabhāveṇaśivoditena subhadrarūpījagaḥtaḥpraśāstātattejasābhātisuśobhamānaḥ <6> puṇyaṃpavitraṃparamaṃrahasyaṃsusārabhūtaṃparikī
rttitaṃmayā ciṃtāmaṇiṃciṃtitakāryasādhanaṃpratyakṣakāryādiphalaprasādhanam <7> vaśyādhikāraṃprathamaṃdvitīyamākarṣaṇaṃstaṃbhakaraṃ
tṛtīyaṃvidveṣaṇaṃmāraṇakaṃcapaṃcamam uccāṭanaṃśāṃtikaraṃcasaptamaṃvaṃdīprasādaṃpravadaṃticāṣṭamamṣṭādhikāraṃkathayaṃtikalpaciṃ
tāmaṇiṃdevavaraiḥsupūjitam <8> [itiśrīdāmodareṇaśivājñākareṇapaṃḍitarājenaviracitoyaṃtraciṃtāmaṇiḥsamāptaḥ] śubhamastu 

